msgid "[_M_] Oh, [ryan], you're so sweet!"
msgstr "[_M_] Och, [ryan], si taký milý!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:700 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_eff831e8:
msgid "[_M_] Today I'm actually drinking in your honor."
msgstr "[_M_] Dnes vlastne pijem na tvoju počesť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:701 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_f6b51e87:
msgid "[_R_] Really?"
msgstr "[_R_] Naozaj?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:702 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_80a46cdc_1:
msgid "[_M_] Yeah.... during my workout this morning, I was thinking about how grateful I am that I didn't have to go to the strip club last night, and for quite a few Saturdays now."
msgstr "[_M_] Áno.... počas ranného tréningu som premýšľala o tom, aká som vďačná, že som včera večer a už niekoľko sobôt nemusela ísť do striptízového klubu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:703 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_f18bcb83_1:
msgid "[_M_] And then I thought about how that is all thanks to you."
msgstr "[_M_] A potom som sa zamyslela nad tým, že to všetko je tvoja zásluha."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:706 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_aeea6a32_1:
msgid "[_M_] I just thought stripping was going to be part of my life again until your dad gets out of prison, but now I feel so much safer now that you've shown you're capable of paying your dad's debt."
msgstr "[_M_] Len som si myslela, že striptíz bude opäť súčasťou môjho života, kým sa tvoj otec nedostane z väzenia, ale teraz sa cítim oveľa bezpečnejšie, keď si ukázal, že si schopný zaplatiť otcov dlh."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:707 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_28ce09a6_1:
msgid "[_R_] It just makes me feel really good to take care of you and make you happy."
msgstr "[_R_] Cítim sa veľmi dobre, keď sa o vás všetkých môžem starať a robiť radosť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:710 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_3e15b1a2:
msgid "[_M_] There has to be something I can do for my boy to thank you for everything you've done for me."
msgstr "[_M_] Musím pre svojho chlapca urobiť niečo, čím sa ti poďakujem za všetko, čo si pre mňa urobil."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:711 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_01a45cb3:
msgid "[_R_] Oh, you don't have to do anything for me, I'm just doing my job as the head of this household."
msgstr "[_R_] Nemusíš pre mňa nič robiť, len si robím svoju prácu ako hlava tejto domácnosti."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:714 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_500162ac:
msgid "[_M_] I'm still head of this household, you're just the man of the house!"
msgstr "[_M_] Ja som stále hlavou tejto domácnosti, ty si len pánom domu!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:715 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_e8419ec9:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}YES!!.... She just acknowledged that I'm the man of the house!{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}ÁNO!!.... Práve uznala, že som mužom v dome!{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:716 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_28c991fb:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Shit!! I just admitted to [ryan] that I think of him as the man of the house now. That's going to give him a bigger head.... the kind above his shoulders.... not the kind.... shit.... why did my mind go there.{/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Do prdele!! Práve som sa priznala [ryan] , že ho teraz považujem za muža v dome. To mu dá väčšiu hlavu.... takú tú nad ramenami.... a nie takú.... sračku.... prečo mi to napadlo? {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:719 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_33b214d5:
msgid "[_M_] But really, I want to do something nice for just you to show how greatful I am to you. Isn't there anything you want to do? .... something that doesn't cost any money of course!"
msgstr "[_M_] Ale naozaj chcem urobiť niečo pekné len pre teba, aby som ti ukázala, ako veľmi som ti vďačná. Nechceš niečo urobiť? .... niečo, čo nestojí žiadne peniaze, samozrejme!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:720 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_b0e40590:
msgid "[_R_] Hmmmm.... It's been a long time since we went swimming at the club, and we always go with Lauren and she takes all of your attention. I'd love to go with just you!"
msgstr "[_R_] Hmmmm.... Už je to dávno, čo sme si boli zaplávať v klube, a vždy chodíme s Lauren a ona na seba strháva všetku tvoju pozornosť. Najradšej by som išiel len s tebou!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:721 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_11351eb2:
msgid "[_M_] I said something that doesn't cost any money, dear..."
msgstr "[_M_] Povedala som niečo, čo nestojí žiadne peniaze, drahý..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:722 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_0519c1d4:
msgid "[_R_] Well, haven't you already paid the annual fee for the club membership?"
msgstr "[_R_] No nezaplatili sme už ročný poplatok za členstvo v klube?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:723 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_e8c9b15e:
msgid "[_M_] Well, yeah.... I mean I guess we have.... but most of the fun is being able to eat at the club restaurant, and to be able to drink some wine and read my book while you kids swim in the pool."
msgstr "[_M_] No, áno.... Myslím, že máme.... ale väčšina zábavy spočíva v tom, že sa môžem najesť v klubovej reštaurácii a môžem piť víno a čítať si knihu, zatiaľ čo vy deti plávate v bazéne."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:724 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_c3b30fac:
msgid "[_M_] I don't know how much I would enjoy spending time at the club without..."
msgstr "[_M_] Neviem, ako veľmi by ma bavilo tráviť čas v klube bez..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:727 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_5dcb76f9:
msgid "[_M_] Wait.... sorry..."
msgstr "[_M_] Počkaj.... Prepáč..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:728 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_a091da8d:
msgid "[_M_] This isn't about what I want.... I want to reward you. So if you want to go swimming at the club pool, then we'll go swimming at the club pool."
msgstr "[_M_] Toto nie je o tom, čo chcem.... Chcem ťa odmeniť. Takže ak chceš ísť plávať do klubového bazéna, pôjdeme plávať do klubového bazéna."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:729 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_f18defd9:
msgid "[_M_] Though, that's not asking much.... are you sure there's nothing else you want?"
msgstr "[_M_] Aj keď to nie je veľa.... si si istí, že už nič iné nechceš?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:735 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_5fe9f6dd:
msgid "[_M_] [upper_ryan]! I can't believe you have the balls to ask your own mother something like that!"
msgstr "[_M_] [upper_ryan]! Nemôžem uveriť, že máš odvahu opýtať sa vlastnej matky na niečo také!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:736 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_eaa6197a:
msgid "[_R_] I know.... I'm sorry.... It's just that I've never seen a girl dance like that, and since I saw you dance at the club, and had to leave early when you saw me.... well.... I'm just really curious how a dance like that ends."
msgstr "[_R_] Viem.... Je mi to ľúto.... Ja len, že som nikdy nevidel dievča takto tancovať, a keďže som ťa videl tancovať v klube a musel som odísť skôr, keď si ma videla.... no.... Som len naozaj zvedavý, ako sa takýto tanec končí."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:739 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_3f3ff523:
msgid "[_M_] [ryan] it's never appropriate to ask your mom to strip for you! What are you thinking?!"
msgstr "[_M_] [ryan] nikdy nie je vhodné požiadať mamu, aby sa pre teba vyzliekla! Čo si myslíš?!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:740 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_5a31fb55:
msgid "[_R_] Oh, no.... you misunderstood, I don't want you to strip for me, I just want to see the dance."
msgstr "[_R_] Oh, no.... si to zle pochopila, nechcem, aby si sa pre mňa vyzliekla, chcem len vidieť ten tanec."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:741 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_3b2aa433:
msgid "[_M_] Oh.... you just want to see the dance? To see me shake my ass? And grind myself up on the pole.... hmmmm.... let me think about it.... how 'bout NO!!"
msgstr "[_M_] Oh.... chceš len vidieť tanec? Vidieť ma, ako si vrtím zadkom? A brúsim sa na tyči.... hmmmm.... nechaj ma o tom premýšľať.... čo tak NIE!!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:742 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_7c406113:
msgid "[_M_] Now go get your swimming stuff and meet me in the car. You're lucky I'm still even taking you after asking me something like that!"
msgstr "[_M_] Teraz si choď po veci na plávanie a stretneme sa v aute. Máš šťastie, že ťa ešte vôbec beriem, keď si ma o niečo také požiadal!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:744 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_6eac641e:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Oh my God, that kid is getting ballsy! To ask ask your own mom to do a strip dance?.... Do I need to do something to put an end to this?.... {/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Panebože, ten chlapec je čoraz odvážnejší! Požiadať vlastnú mamu o striptízový tanec? .... Mám niečo urobiť, aby sa to skončilo?.... {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:745 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_9806f6f0:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Why is it that I'm not more upset about this? Do I feel flattered that my own son would want to see me shake my ass?{/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Prečo ma to nerozrušilo viac? Mám sa cítiť polichotená, že môj vlastný syn by ma chcel vidieť, ako si natriasam zadok?{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:746 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_0d2f6af7:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Oh.... I know.... I'm just extra horny since [dad_name] hasn't been around to satisfy my needs, and a dildo and butt plug just aren't an adequate substitute.{/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Oh.... Ja viem.... Som len mimoriadne nadržaná, keďže [dad_name] nebol nablízku, aby uspokojil moje potreby, a vibrátor a análny kolík jednoducho nie sú adekvátnou náhradou.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:747 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_7397d4d5:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Otherwise.... I wouldn't let this kind of shit fly at all!!.... {/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Inak.... Takéto sračky by som vôbec nenechala lietať!!.... {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:753 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_5fe9f6dd_1:
msgid "[_M_] [upper_ryan]! I can't believe you have the balls to ask your own mother something like that!"
msgstr "[_M_] [upper_ryan]! Nemôžem uveriť, že máš odvahu opýtať sa vlastnej matky na niečo také!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:754 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_178493d7:
msgid "[_R_] Oh, no.... I think you misunderst..."
msgstr "[_R_] Oh, no.... Myslím, že sme sa nepochopili..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:755 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_dd6d5517:
msgid "[_M_] I don't care what you meant, there is no possible way that you could have asked that in a way that is appropriate!"
msgstr "[_M_] Je mi jedno, čo si tým myslel, neexistuje spôsob, ako sa na to dá spýtať vhodným spôsobom!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:756 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_53f67a71:
msgid "[_M_] I wanted to do something nice for you today to say thank you, but you have to go and act like this!?"
msgstr "[_M_] Chcela som pre teba dnes urobiť niečo pekné, aby som ti poďakovala, ale ty musíš ísť a správať sa takto!?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:757 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_7de12081:
msgid "[_M_] I still very much appreciate what you've done for me, but we'll have to see if you're more deserving for a reward next Sunday."
msgstr "[_M_] Stále si veľmi vážim, čo si pre mňa urobil, ale uvidíme, či si zaslúžiš väčšiu odmenu na budúcu nedeľu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:758 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_c1ed24bb:
msgid "[_R_] But I didn't mean..."
msgstr "[_R_] Ale ja som nemal na mysli..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:761 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_86ad8d0c:
msgid "[_M_] No butts!"
msgstr "[_M_] Žiadne zadky!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:762 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_ac4f02a6:
msgid "[_M_] I'm out of here!"
msgstr "[_M_] Odchádzam odtiaľto!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:763 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_weekend_pool_01_974a7df8:
msgid "[_M_] I've got to go cool down somewhere."
