# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3636 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_c71787e8:
msgid "[_MG_] I'm sure you're already aware, but [ryan] has a photo studio that's beginning to do fairly well."
msgstr "[_MG_] Určite to už vieš, ale na stránke [ryan] je fotoateliér, ktorému sa začína celkom dobre dariť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3637 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_988d8a9d:
msgid "[_M_] I know it's bringing in a little money each week."
msgstr "[_M_] Viem, že každý týždeň prinesie trochu peňazí."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3638 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_cb34e854:
msgid "[_M_] And I know Lauren and Sidney have been posing for pictures, in outfits that Sidney has designed."
msgstr "[_M_] A viem, že Lauren a Sidney pózovali na fotkách v oblečení, ktoré navrhla Sidney."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3641 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_80935de1:
msgid "[_MG_] Exactly... and those shoots have started to get a good amount of attention online."
msgstr "[_MG_] Presne tak... a tieto zábery začali na internete pútať pozornosť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3644 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_1ecad11b:
msgid "[_M_] Oh, really?"
msgstr "[_M_] Oh, naozaj?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3645 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_0e89c9e0:
msgid "[_MG_] Yeah, in fact I thought that I'd already convinced [ryan] to let me be part of a photoshoot, but I guess I wasn't persuasive enough!"
msgstr "[_MG_] Áno, vlastne som si myslela, že som už presvedčila [ryan] , aby som sa mohla zúčastniť na fotení, ale asi som nebola dostatočne presvedčivá!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3646 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_54250e64:
msgid "[_R_] I've just been busy. I kinda forgot."
msgstr "[_R_] Bol som len zaneprázdnený. Tak trochu som zabudol."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3647 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_c878db5d:
msgid "[_MG_] Well, I've been trying to get internet famous for years by posting pics and vids of my cheerleading stuff, and makeup and fashion tutorials."
msgstr "[_MG_] No, už roky sa snažím presláviť na internete tým, že zverejňujem fotky a videá svojich roztlieskavačských vecí a návody na líčenie a módu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3648 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_a9790eba:
msgid "[_MG_] But besides the occasional creepy stalker, I haven't been able to get a very good following."
msgstr "[_MG_] Ale okrem občasných strašidelných sledovateľov sa mi nepodarilo získať veľmi dobrú sledovanosť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3649 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_a9ee5a67:
msgid "[_MG_] But, I think [ryan]'s got a good thing going with his studio."
msgstr "[_MG_] Myslím si však, že [ryan]má so svojím štúdiom úspech."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3650 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_441ad4df:
msgid "[_MG_] Cosplay is extremely popular right now."
msgstr "[_MG_] Cosplay je v súčasnosti mimoriadne populárny."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3653 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_b2f65e1b:
msgid "[_M_] Well, I'm sure that [ryan] would be more than happy to take some pictures of you in cosplay."
msgstr "[_M_] Som si istá, že [ryan] by ťa veľmi rád odfotil v kostýme."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3654 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_26224cff:
msgid "[_M_] Wouldn't you, [ryan]?"
msgstr "[_M_] Nechcel by si, [ryan]?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3655 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_dabfa705:
msgid "[_R_] Ummm... yeah... I'd love to get another model in there."
msgstr "[_R_] Ummm... áno... rád by som tam dostal ďalší model."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3656 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_cf9ff8a2:
msgid "[_MG_] Great, but here's the part you're not going to like, Miss [mom_name]."
msgstr "[_MG_] Skvelé, ale toto je časť, ktorá sa ti nebude páčiť, slečna [mom_name]."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3657 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_973f4085:
msgid "[_MG_] I have a feeling the photoshoot will be ten times more popular if I'm posing with a beautiful, sexy, more mature woman."
msgstr "[_MG_] Mám pocit, že fotenie bude desaťkrát populárnejšie, ak budem pózovať s krásnou, sexi a zrelšou ženou."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3660 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_2325cda7:
msgid "[_M_] You mean me."
msgstr "[_M_] To myslíš mňa."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3661 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_6637bdee:
msgid "[_MG_] Yes."
msgstr "[_MG_] Áno."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3662 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_741a4721:
msgid "[_M_] There's no way!... I can't pose in sexy photos with one of my students!"
msgstr "[_M_] To nie je možné!... Nemôžem pózovať na sexi fotkách s jedným zo svojich študentov!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3665 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_031dd183:
msgid "[_M_] That would destroy my reputation."
msgstr "[_M_] To by zničilo moju reputáciu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3666 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_f1074e1a:
msgid "[_MG_] Destroy it? No... When I was a freshman, a video leaked of Miss Stone fucking one of her students, and now her class fills up faster than any other."
msgstr "[_MG_] Zničiť ju? Nie... Keď som bola v prvom ročníku, uniklo video, na ktorom slečna Stoneová súloží s jedným zo svojich študentov, a teraz sa jej trieda napĺňa rýchlejšie ako ktorákoľvek iná."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3667 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_fef31cb9:
msgid "[_MG_] It's mostly boys, but the event only boosted her status among the students."
msgstr "[_MG_] Sú to väčšinou chlapci, ale táto udalosť len zvýšila jej postavenie medzi študentmi."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3668 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_20d176ca:
msgid "[_MG_] I was really surprised she didn't get fired."
msgstr "[_MG_] Bola som naozaj prekvapená, že ju nevyhodili."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3669 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_55f2cff9:
msgid "[_M_] That's because the student was over 18, and the state has a law that schools can't punish teachers for that type of behavior if the student is a consenting adult."
msgstr "[_M_] Dôvodom je, že študent bol starší ako 18 rokov a štát má zákon, podľa ktorého školy nemôžu trestať učiteľov za takéto správanie, ak je študent dospelý."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3670 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_6adc13c0:
msgid "[_M_] They didn't even bring it before the school board because there were no grounds for dimissal."
msgstr "[_M_] Dokonca to ani nepredložili školskej rade, pretože neexistovali dôvody na zamietnutie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3671 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_307a5dda:
msgid "[_M_] It probably helped that she has tenure as well."
msgstr "[_M_] Pravdepodobne jej pomohlo aj to, že má funkčné obdobie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3672 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_c8b77667:
msgid "[_R_] You have tenure too, Miss [mom_name]."
msgstr "[_R_] Aj ty máš funkčné obdobie, slečna [mom_name]."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3675 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_a36e0053:
msgid "[_M_] Shut up, [ryan]!"
msgstr "[_M_] Sklapni, [ryan]!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3678 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_e595badc:
msgid "[_MG_] [ryan] could even put the pictures behind a paywall for premium members, then probably none of your students would see the pics, since almost none of us have access to credit cards."
msgstr "[_MG_] [ryan] dokonca by si mohol obrázky umiestniť za platenú stenu pre prémiových členov, potom by ich pravdepodobne nikto zo študentov nevidel, pretože takmer nikto z nás nemá prístup ku kreditným kartám."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3681 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_8aec5b01:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Let's see... a formal investigation and scandal for me and [ryan], or taking sexy pics with a student, which probably no one will see?{/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Pozrime sa... formálne vyšetrovanie a škandál pre mňa a [ryan], alebo fotenie sexy fotiek so študentkou, ktoré pravdepodobne nikto neuvidí?{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3684 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_3ba1d641:
msgid "[_M_] Fine!... I'll do the photoshoot."
msgstr "[_M_] Dobre!... Urobím fotenie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3685 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_914efb7a:
msgid "[_MG_] Yay! That's awesome!"
