msgid "[_M_] Well, I might add that she's one of the reasons I started stripping after I finished high school."
msgstr "No, môžem dodať, že je jedným z dôvodov, prečo som začal prať po tom, čo som dokončil strednú školu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4235 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_36969999:
msgid "[_M_] Morgan and I got our first stripping job together."
msgstr "[_ M_] Morgana a ja sme spolu mali našu prvú stripknú prácu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4236 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_08b55f7d:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}If I could just go back in time!{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Ak by som sa mohol vrátiť v čase! {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4239 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_fa658b08:
msgid "{i}A little while later.{/i}"
msgstr "{i}o chvíľu neskôr. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4242 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_d55f27c4:
msgid "[_M_] Haha... that's it... Now try to eat it in one bite."
msgstr "Haha ... to je všetko. Teraz sa to snažte zjesť v jednom uhryznutie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4243 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_e18078f3:
msgid "[_M_] The Itamae, or sushi chef, if you like, makes each sushi to be perfectly balanced with flavor, so to properly enjoy it, you need to eat it in one bite."
msgstr "[_M_] Itamae, alebo sushi kuchár, ak sa vám páči, robí každý sushi byť dokonale vyvážený s chuťou, tak, aby správne vychutnať to, budete musieť jesť v jednom uhryznutie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4246 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_5f6f87bd:
msgid "[_M_] Good, right?"
msgstr "[_ M_] Dobré, že?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4247 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_5420d556:
msgid "[_R_] Mmmrrrrmpphhh..."
msgstr "[_R_] Mmmrrrmpphhh ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4248 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_ad8a4a9a:
msgid "[_W_] I'm so sorry to interrupt!"
msgstr "Je mi ľúto, že vás prerušujem!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4251 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_8837f5f7:
msgid "[_W_] I know I said I wouldn't disturb you, but there is a representative of Mister DeCapo requesting an audience."
msgstr "[_W_] Viem, že som povedal, že by som vás nerušil, ale je tu zástupca Mister DeCapo, ktorý žiada publikum."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4252 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_c13c2710:
msgid "[_M_] Oh, send him in."
msgstr "Pošlite ho sem."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4253 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_b1f73f74:
msgid "[_W_] They actually want to talk to Mr. [ryan] in private."
msgstr "V skutočnosti chcú hovoriť s pánom [ryan] v súkromí."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4254 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_3bbaac75:
msgid "[_W_] Would you mind following me Mr. [ryan]?"
msgstr "Vadilo by vám, aby ste ma nasledovali pán [ryan]?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4255 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_2091477c:
msgid "[_R_] What in the hell is this abou..."
msgstr "[_ R_] Čo do pekla je to ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4256 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_a24d746f:
msgid "[_M_] Of course he wouldn't mind. You don't say no to a request from Mr. DeCapo."
msgstr "-Samozrejme, že by to nevadilo. Nevraveli ste, že na žiadosť pána DeCapo nie je žiadaný."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4262 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_f1cb3ca9:
msgid "[_A_] Surprise! It's just me."
msgstr "[Á_] ] Prekvapenie! To som len ja."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4263 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_72394fbb:
msgid "[_R_] Oh, hey Armani. I thought you left with Joey."
msgstr "Oh, hej Armani. Myslel som, že si odišiel s Joeym."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4264 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_5cd64f49:
msgid "[_A_] I was supposed to, but as we were waiting for the valet, Joey got an emergency call about something that couldn't wait."
msgstr "[_A_] Mal som, ale ako sme čakali na valet, Joey dostal núdzový hovor o niečom, čo nemohol čakať."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4265 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_9d435809:
msgid "[_A_] So, I'm stuck waiting until Joey's backup driver gets here, and the way traffic is at this time of day, it might be a while."
msgstr "Takže, trčím tu čakám, kým sem príde Joeyho záložný šofér, a cestná premávka je v tomto čase, to môže byť nejaký čas."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4266 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_21889a36:
msgid "[_A_] And the worst part is I'm super bored because I forgot to grab my phone out of the car."
msgstr "A najhoršie na tom je, že som sa znudila, pretože som zabudla vziať telefón z auta."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4267 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_926cb9ba:
msgid "[_A_] And as I was sitting at the bar waiting, I remembered that you were here, and probably just as excited to be on a date with your mom as I am to be on a date with my uncle."
msgstr "[_A_] A keď som sedel pri bare, čakal som, že si tu, a asi tak nadšený, že si bol na rande s tvojou mamou, ako by som mal byť na rande s mojím strýkom."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4268 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_577e004b:
msgid "[_A_] And I'm guessing you had about as much choice in the matter as I did."
msgstr "[_A_] A tipujem, že ste mali v tejto veci toľko možností, ako som to urobil."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4269 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_3e0fa6ec:
msgid "[_R_] Actually, I'm the one who invited my mom out on a date."
msgstr "[_ R_] Vlastne, ja som ten, kto pozval moju mamu na rande."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4272 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_4939174e:
msgid "[_A_] Really?"
msgstr "[_A_] Naozaj?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4273 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_b7035b64:
msgid "[_R_] Yeah, she's going through some pretty hard stuff, so I wanted to cheer her up, but honestly, I enjoy spending time with her."
msgstr "Áno, prechádza peknými tvrdými veškami, tak som ju chcel rozveseať, ale úprimne, bavím sa s ňou tráviť čas."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4274 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_1b21fe81:
msgid "[_A_] Oh, I'm sorry to have interrupted you then, but please, Will you do something with me for just a minute?"
msgstr "Je mi ľúto, že som ťa prerušil, ale prosím ťa, urobíš niečo so mnou len na chvíľu?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4275 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_90f6238f:
msgid "[_R_] Do you have something in mind?"
msgstr "-Máte niečo na mysli?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4278 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_0e056384:
msgid "[_A_] Yes, and before you decide, just follow me for a minute."
msgstr "[_A_] Áno, a predtým, než sa rozhodnete, len ma nasledujte za minútu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4281 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_b7456db6:
msgid "[_R_] That's the men's bathroom. Why are you going in there?"
msgstr "To je pánska kúpeľňa. Prečo tam ideš?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4282 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_3392a8b1:
msgid "[_A_] Because I have a feeling you wouldn't follow me into the ladies room."
msgstr "[_ A_] Pretože mám pocit, že by ste ma nesledovali v dámskej miestnosti."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4285 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_bbbcf5a7:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}What is this?... I'm supposed to follow her into the men's room?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Čo je to? ... Mal by som ju nasledovať do mužskej izby?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4291 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_d020eaa9:
msgid "[_A_] Oh, good! I was starting to worry that maybe you wouldn't follow."
msgstr "Oh, dobre! Začal som sa obávať, že by ste sa možno nesledovali."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4294 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_f21560c0:
msgid "[_A_] I'm so glad you did though!"
msgstr "[_ A_] Som tak rád, že ste to urobil!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4295 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_c7f25f8d:
msgid "[_A_] You know..."
msgstr "[_A_] Viete ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4298 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_1bc12156:
msgid "[_A_] I never did get a chance to properly thank you for saving my life."
msgstr "[_A_] Nikdy som nemal šancu správne poďakovať za záchranu môjho života."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4299 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_eef2f352:
msgid "[_A_] Who knows what The Chin would have done to us if you hadn't come when you did."
msgstr "[_ A_] Kto vie, čo by nám Chin urobil, ak by si neprišiel, keď by si to urobil."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4302 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_0cec3e07:
msgid "[_A_] Diaz said he was about to shove a wrench in her ass before you walked in."
msgstr "[_A_] Diaz povedal, že sa chystá strčiť kľúč v zadku, než ste vošiel."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4303 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_fb3624d6:
msgid "[_A_] I don't even want to think about what would have happened if he had more time."
msgstr "[_A_] Ani nechcem myslieť na to, čo by sa stalo, keby mal viac času."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4306 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_34804079:
msgid "[_A_] And I know Sidney took your v-card to properly thank you for saving us, and while I'm not ready to have sex with you..."
msgstr "[_A_] A ja viem, že Sidney vzal vašu kartu, aby správne poďakoval za záchranu nás, a zatiaľ čo ja nie som pripravený mať sex s vami ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4309 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_a741448d:
msgid "[_A_] Maybe we could mess around?"
msgstr "[_ A_] Možno by sme mohli zahanbovať?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4310 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_baabd61a:
msgid "[_R_] Normally I'd be all about that, but I feel bad for leaving my mom all alone."
msgstr "Normálne by som bol o tom všetkom, ale cítim sa zle, že som nechal moju mamu na pokoji."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4313 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_a001c889:
msgid "[_A_] If she's got food and wine, she should be good on her own for a couple minutes."
msgstr "[_A_] Ak má jedlo a víno, tak by mala byť na pár minút dobrá."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4314 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_376e6818:
msgid "[_A_] Why are you so worried?"
msgstr "Prečo sa tak bojíš?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4315 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_dc7a84b6:
msgid "[_R_] ...."
msgstr "[_R_] ...."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4318 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_1931d5dc:
msgid "[_A_] Oh, my God!"
msgstr "Oh, môj Bože!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4319 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_04c3fadc:
msgid "[_A_] You have the hots for her too, don't you?"
msgstr "Aj pre ňu máš kopu, nie?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4320 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_24cd4896:
msgid "[_R_] No, I..."
msgstr "[_R_] Nie, ja ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4321 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_48f6e799:
msgid "[_A_] You are so much more depraved than I gave you credit for."
msgstr "[_ A_] Ste oveľa viac skazený, ako som vám dal úver."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4322 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_a096e0cc:
msgid "[_R_] Uhhh... Yes, fine... You already know about Sidney and I, so I guess you knowing that I have the hots for my mom doesn't make much of a difference."
msgstr "[_R_] Uhhh ... Áno, fajn ... Ty už vieš o Sidney a ja, takže si myslím, že vieš, že mám kopu pre moju mamu, ale nič nie je v tom rozdiel."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4323 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_4a498945:
msgid "[_R_] You must think I'm disgusting."
msgstr "[_ R_] Musíte si myslieť, že som nechutný."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4326 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_83e5ad47:
msgid "[_A_] You'd think so, but no... I kinda grew up being used to the idea."
msgstr "[_ A_] Vy by ste si to mysleli, ale nie ... Vyrastal som v tom, že som bol zvykaný na myšlienku."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4327 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_efe6a722:
msgid "[_A_] You see, our family is from the old country, and before we fled there, we were part of the royalty."
msgstr "[_A_] Vy vidíte, naša rodina pochádza zo starej krajiny, a predtým, než sme tam utiekli, boli sme súčasťou kráľovskej rodiny."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4328 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_acbfa4b9:
msgid "[_A_] We actually are direct descendants of the Borgias, if you've ever heard of them."
msgstr "Vlastne sme priamym potomkom Borgiasu, ak ste o nich niekedy počuli."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4329 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_6c095719:
msgid "[_R_] Yeah. I think I've played a video game where they were the bad guys."
msgstr "[_ R_] Áno. Myslím, že som hral videohru tam, kde boli tí zlí."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4330 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_aaefee17:
msgid "[_A_] Yep, that's them, only we're kinda proud to be their descendants."
msgstr "[_A_] Yep, to je oni, len my sme hrdí na to, že sú ich potomkovia."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4331 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_ff39cb2f:
msgid "[_A_] And our branch has been trying to keep the bloodline pretty pure, so marriage between cousins, and sometimes even closer relations, is pretty common in our family."
msgstr "[_A_] A naša pobočka sa snaží udržať krvnú líniu celkom čisté, takže manželstvo medzi bratrancami, a niekedy aj užšie vzťahy, je celkom bežné v našej rodine."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4334 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_dd6d9b5d:
msgid "[_A_] In fact, the main reason my mom lets me work with my uncle in a strip club, is she's hoping I'll seduce him and bring the ruling branch back under her."
msgstr "[_ A_] V skutočnosti, hlavný dôvod, prečo moja mama dovolí, aby som pracoval s mojím strýkom v stripkom klube, je ona dúfa, že ho zvesejem a priviesť vládnucu vetva späť pod ňou."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4335 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_6ddb1e57:
msgid "[_A_] She tried to seduce Joey herself when they were teenagers, but he was more interested in their cousin."
msgstr "Snažila sa sa Joey, keď boli tínedžeri, ale viac sa zaujímal o ich bratranca."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4338 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_aba8bfab:
msgid "[_A_] So, you see... Not so weird to me."
msgstr "[_A_] Takže, vidíte ... Nie je to pre mňa tak zvláštne."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4339 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_82f30cfd:
msgid "[_R_] Hmmm..."
msgstr "[_R_] Hmmm ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4343 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_39d18a67:
msgid "[_A_] Maybe these can help you decide?"
msgstr "[_ A_] Možno vám môžu pomôcť rozhodnúť sa?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4344 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_dc7a84b6_1:
msgid "[_R_] ...."
msgstr "[_R_] ...."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4345 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_5f1e8af6:
msgid "[_R_] Wow!"
msgstr "[_R_] Wow!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4348 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_e79200f3:
msgid "[_A_] And keep in mind, I guarantee that I'll make you nut."
msgstr "[_A_] A majte na pamäti, garantujem ti, že ti urobím maticu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4349 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_0bfa9905:
msgid "[_A_] I doubt your mom is offering such a good deal."
msgstr "Pochybujem, že tvoja mama ponúka takú dobrú dohodu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4350 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_f48dcabc:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I probably shouldn't tell her that Mom already made me nut today.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Pravdepodobne by som jej nemal povedať, že mama mi dnes urobila maticu. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4351 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_22ec9b82:
msgid "[_A_] So, what do you choose?"
msgstr "[_A_] Takže, čo si vyberiete?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4354 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_145e6c35:
msgid "[_R_] I'm really sorry, but I really need to get back to my mom."
msgstr "[_ R_] Je mi to naozaj ľúto, ale naozaj sa musím vrátiť k mojej mame."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4357 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_82e85c93:
msgid "[_A_] Oh..."
msgstr "[_A_] Oh..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4358 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_c4a9b853:
msgid "[_R_] It's just, I'm sure she's worried sick. She thinks Joey has an important message for me, and if I take too long, she's going to start fearing the worst."
msgstr "[_R_] Je to len, som si istý, že ona je znepokojená chorá. Myslí si, že Joey má pre mňa dôležitý odkaz, a ak budem trvať príliš dlho, začne sa báť najhoršieho."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4359 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_96c05b54:
msgid "[_A_] Yeah... That makes sense."
msgstr "[_ A_] Áno ... To dáva zmysel."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4360 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_f6eca880:
msgid "[_A_] ...."
msgstr "[_A_] ...."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4361 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_1f4c0f23:
msgid "[_A_] Sorry, I just haven't ever had a guy reject me before."
msgstr "Prepáč, ešte som nikdy predtým nemal chlapa, ktorý ma odmietol."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4364 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_4ea41d6a:
msgid "[_A_] But I understand."
msgstr "Ale rozumiem."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:4365 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_sushi_date_dea08394:
msgid "[_A_] You make a good point. You should run back to your mom. I wouldn't want to leave her worried either."
