# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:16925 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_sidney_monster_path_69d46914:
msgid "[_S_] [ryan]! You've got to help me! Some... thing!... Like... a monster, pulled me through the mirror into this... I don't know... scary version of our bathroom."
