msgstr "[_ M_] Camille, spomínaš si na agenta FBI, ktorý vám pomohol pohnúť sa?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21204 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_de81bc24:
msgid "[_C_] I don't know, maybe? What about her?"
msgstr "[_ C_] Neviem, možno? A čo s ňou?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21205 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_08881def:
msgid "[_M_] She's in his club every time I've been in there. You think she'd be hanging out in an illegal club if he didn't have her and god knows who else on his payroll?!"
msgstr "Je vo svojom klube vždy, keď som tam bol. Myslíš si, že by sa mohla poflakovať v ilegálnom klube, ak by ju nemal a Boh vie, kto iný na výplatnej listine?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21206 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_382f2116:
msgid "[_R_] {i}(Muttering){/i} Pretty sure that our city's mayor is a regular there too."
msgstr "[_R_] {i}(Muttering) {/i} Som si istý, že starosta nášho mesta je pravidelná taky."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21207 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_460ed95d:
msgid "[_M_] I always knew you were selfish, but I didn't think you were an idiot!"
msgstr "Vždy som vedel, že si sebecký, ale nemyslel som si, že si idiot!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21210 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_7845abcb:
msgid "[_C_] Hey, the only reason any of this happened is because of your {i}idiot{/i} husband!"
msgstr "[_C_] Hej, jediný dôvod, prečo sa to stalo, je ten tvoj {i}idiot {/i} manžel!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21211 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_faa67948:
msgid "[_M_] At least my husband didn't run off with the {b}nanny{/b}!"
msgstr "[_M_] Aspoň môj manžel nevybehla s {b}nannym {/b}!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21212 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_5b3eed7d:
msgid "[_R_] Uncle Bobby was Dad's right hand man, Aunt Cami. He's just as much to blame as Dad."
msgstr "[_ R_] Ustrýko Bobby bol ocino pravá ruka muža, teta Cami. Je to len toľko, čo je na vine ako otec."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21213 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_b52fea57:
msgid "[_C_] Stay out of this, you little runt!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Zostaňte mimo tohto, ty malý runt!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21214 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_d5566705:
msgid "[_M_] {b}Don't you talk to my son like that, you bitch! You're the one who's endangered this family!{/b}"
msgstr "[_ M_] {b}Nehovorte s mojím synom takto, ty suka! Vy ste ten, kto ohrozil túto rodinu!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21215 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_01b4bbe8:
msgid "[_C_] {b}Don't call me a bitch, you...{/b}"
msgstr "[_C_] {b}Nevolaj ma suka, ty ... {/b}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21216 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_1e1c2ed6:
msgid "[_MD_] Mom?"
msgstr "Mami?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21219 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_3956ecc6:
msgid "[_C_] Mandy!"
msgstr "[_C_] Mandy!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21220 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_27efc408:
msgid "[_MD_] Did you really get us into trouble with the mob?"
msgstr "Naozaj si nás dostal do problémov s mafiou?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21221 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_8aa039b1:
msgid "[_C_] Baby, it's not like that. I did it for us."
msgstr "Baby, to nie je také. Urobil som to pre nás."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21222 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_41a2294f:
msgid "[_S_] Why is everyone yelling?"
msgstr "Prečo všetci kričí?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21225 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_c20775b5:
msgid "[_S_] What's going on?"
msgstr "[_S_] Čo sa deje?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21226 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_604a034d:
msgid "[_M_] Well? Go on Camille..."
msgstr "[_ M_] No? Choď na Camille ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21227 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_5a03f786:
msgid "[_M_] Tell our girls why you've put all their lives in danger so you could have some fun at a mafia casino."
msgstr "[_ M_] Povedzte našim dievčatám, prečo ste dali všetky svoje životy v nebezpečenskom prípade, takže by ste mohli mať nejakú zábavu v kasíne mafie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21228 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_98f001be:
msgid "[_C_] That's not what happened!"
msgstr "[_ C_] To nie je to, čo sa stalo!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21229 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_107ff339:
msgid "[_C_] Girls, look..."
msgstr "Dievčatá, pozri ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21230 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_2676a1f4:
msgid "[_C_] I... I borrowed some money from Joey DeCapo."
msgstr "[_C_] I. .. Požičal som si nejaké peniaze od Joeyho DeCapa."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21231 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_cfa4ae8a:
msgid "[_S_] What?"
msgstr "[_S_] Čo?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21232 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_82bd0641:
msgid "[_MD_] The mob boss? But, why? Isn't that how Uncle [dad_name] got in trouble?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Mob šéf? Ale prečo? Nie je to tak, ako sa strýko [dad_name] dostal do problémov?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21233 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_7ecf6601:
msgid "[_C_] I was... You see..."
msgstr "[_C_] Bol som ... Vidíš ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21234 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_49f3af73:
msgid "[_C_] I was trying to, to win enough money to pay off [dad_name]'s debt!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Snažil som sa, vyhrať dosť peňazí na zaplatenie off [dad_name] ''s dlhu!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21235 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_1c17a687:
msgid "[_C_] If I won big at the club, then I could pay it all off, and we'd all get our lives back."
msgstr "[_ C_] Ak som vyhral veľký v klube, potom by som mohol zaplatiť to všetko preč, a všetci by sme sa naše životy späť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21236 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_c0b5c051:
msgid "[_R_] Bullshit!"
msgstr "-Bullshit!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21237 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_ad14a32b:
msgid "[_R_] You said you were going to take Mandy and leave the rest of us. Going back to living the good life, you said... Buying expensive wines, and getting \"manny petties\", whatever that hell that is."
msgstr "[_ R_] Vy ste povedali, že budete brať Mandy a nechať zvyšok z nás. Vraciaš sa späť k životu ten dobrý život, povedal si ... Nákup drahých vín, a získanie \"manny petties\", čokoľvek to peklo, to je."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21238 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_525b3774:
msgid "[_MD_] You were going to run out on them? Like Dad did to us?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Chystáte sa na ne vybehať? Tak ako nám to urobil otec?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21239 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_a2ed6b24:
msgid "[_M_] Unbelievable! After I took you into my home, you'd abandon us, just so you could sip Chateau wines and have your nails done?"
msgstr "[_ M_] Neuveriteľné! Potom, čo som ťa vzal do môjho domu, opustil by si nás, len aby si mohol popíjať Chateau vína a nechať si robiť nechty?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21240 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_1db3343f:
msgid "[_M_] You ungrateful cunt!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Vy nevďačné teta!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21243 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_06b9ae4c:
msgid "[_C_] Don't talk to me like that!"
msgstr "-Nerozprávaj sa so mnou takto!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21244 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_f3a9fb46:
msgid "[_C_] This isn't my fault! None of this is my fault!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Toto nie je moja chyba! Nič z toho nie je moja chyba!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21245 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_c873b5d5:
msgid "[_C_] I had the perfect life! A rich husband, a daughter I could spoil with all my attention, in my spacious house!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Mal som dokonalý život! S bohatým manželom, dcérenkou, ktorú by som mohol kaziť všetkou mojou pozorou, v mojom priestrannom dome!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21246 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_d2525d04:
msgid "[_C_] Now, I'm stuck living with my sister and her family."
msgstr "[_ C_] Teraz, som uviazol v živote s mojou sestrou a jej rodiny."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21247 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_7b75fb88:
msgid "[_C_] Your son is bad enough, always bossing me around or trying to perv on me and my daughter."
msgstr "[_ C_] Váš syn je dosť zlý, vždy ma šéfuje okolo alebo sa pokúšam o mňa a mojej dcérake."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21248 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_74dd52f2:
msgid "[_C_] But you!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Ale vy!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21249 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_032b2cea:
msgid "[_C_] You humiliate me every chance you get, [mom_name]! Making me clean your house in that stupid maid costume while your son leers at me."
msgstr "Ponížeš ma každú šancu, ktorú dostaneš, [mom_name]! Aby som vyčistil tvoj dom v tej hlúpe kostýme, zatiaľ čo na mňa tvoj syn Leers."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21250 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_1e00af5a:
msgid "[_C_] I have to scrub your dammed bathroom in that skimpy thing!"
msgstr "[_C_] I have to drrub your dammed bathroom in that skimpy thing!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21251 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_9d9dab82:
msgid "[_C_] I hate that bathroom!"
msgstr "-Neznášam tú kúpeľňu!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21252 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_edcdae72:
msgid "[_C_] There's always pee on the toilet seat, and the hair from five girls in the shower drain!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Vždy je na toaletnom sedadle, a vlasy z piatich dievčat v sprchovom odtoku!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21253 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_1da185a9:
msgid "[_C_] It's degrading!"
msgstr "Degraduje sa!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21254 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_f7d731b4:
msgid "[_C_] Six people in this house, and only {b}one bathroom!{/b}"
msgstr "Šesť ľudí v tomto dome, a len {b}jedna kúpeľňa! {/b}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21255 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_b6a35d45:
msgid "[_C_] {b}One bathroom that I have to clean in that stupid sexy maid costume!{/b}"
msgstr "[_C_] {b}Jedna kúpeľňa, ktorú musím čistiť v tej hlúpej sexy kostýme!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21256 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_0ce449ba:
msgid "[_C_] Well, you know what? I'm not going to put up with this shit anymore!"
msgstr "[_ C_] No, viete čo? Už sa s tým nechystám vystríhať!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21259 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_0338b8ca:
msgid "[_C_] Mandy, get dressed and get your things together. We're leaving."
msgstr "Mandy, obleč sa a daj si veci dokopy. Odchádzame."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21260 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_0a630831:
msgid "[_MD_] We're leaving? Why?"
msgstr "Odchádzame? Prečo?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21261 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_205d747c:
msgid "[_C_] I said get dressed!"
msgstr "Povedal som sa obliecť!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21264 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_19cb5e8e:
msgid "[_M_] Oh, here we go."
msgstr "[_M_] Oh, ideme na to."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21265 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_ae637927:
msgid "[_M_] Little Camille makes a mess, then runs away from home because she doesn't want to face the consequences."
msgstr "[_ M_] Malá Camille robí neporiadok, potom uteší z domu, pretože nechce čeliť následkom."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21266 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_126e45bc:
msgid "[_M_] How many times did you perform this little drama for Mom and Dad?"
msgstr "[_M_] Koľko krát ste vykonali túto malú drámu pre mamu a otca?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21267 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_46f77175:
msgid "[_C_] Shut up!"
msgstr "Sklapni!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21268 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_2e2c108a:
msgid "[_C_] I don't have to live like this!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Nie je potrebné žiť takto!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21269 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_81d93ea2:
msgid "[_M_] Fine with me. Go!"
msgstr "-Dobre, so mnou. -Choď!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21270 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_501e1175:
msgid "[_M_] Go sleep in your car for all I care! That'll be so much better for Mandy!"
msgstr "Spi v aute pre všetko, čo ma zaujíma! To bude pre Mandy oveľa lepšie!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21271 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_225b4138:
msgid "[_C_] I have friends! Good, wealthy friends, who'll take us in and treat me with some respect."
msgstr "Mám priateľov! Dobrí, bohatí priatelia, ktorí nás tam zoberú a doprajú so mnou s rešpektom."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21272 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_824b31c0:
msgid "[_M_] What? Those country club snobs?"
msgstr "[_M_] Čo? Tie country klubu snobi?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21273 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_cf22926a:
msgid "[_M_] Hah! Good luck with that!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Hah! Veľa šťastia s tým!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21274 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_3345fee6:
msgid "[_M_] Do you know where all my good wealthy friends went as soon as they found out about [dad_name]?"
msgstr "[_ M_] Viete, kde sa všetci moji dobrí bohvie priatelia išli hneď, ako sa zistili o [dad_name]?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21275 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_59d6c27e:
msgid "[_M_] Vanished like a fart in the wind."
msgstr "[_M_] Vanished ako prd vo vetre."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21276 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_138cc9bf:
msgid "[_C_] That probably says more about you than them!"
msgstr "[_ C_] To pravdepodobne hovorí viac o vás ako oni!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21277 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_afc1014b:
msgid "[_C_] Now get moving, Mandy!... Just pack what you need for a couple days. We can come back for the rest of our stuff."
msgstr "[_ C_] Teraz sa hýb, Mandy! ... Len si zbav to, čo potrebuješ na pár dní. Môžeme sa vrátiť na zvyšok našich vecí."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21283 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_1c0ec001:
msgid "[_R_] Wow, I can't believe they're really leaving..."
msgstr "[_ R_] Wow, nemôžem uveriť, že naozaj odchádzajú ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21284 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_24c5dfe0:
msgid "[_L_] Mom, is the mob going to go after Mandy and Aunt Camille?"
msgstr "Mami, je mob ísť po Mandy a tete Camille?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21285 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_957462e5:
msgid "[_M_] No, I told Mr. DeCapo that I would find a way to pay Camille's gambling debts."
msgstr "[_M_] Nie, povedal som pánovi DeCapovi, že nájdem spôsob, ako zaplatiť dlhy v Camille za hazardné hry."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21286 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_9658bf24:
msgid "[_S_] How much did Aunt Camille lose?"
msgstr "Ako veľmi sa teta Camille stratila?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21287 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_193e7b17:
msgid "[_M_] A lot."
msgstr "[_ M_] Veľa."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21288 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_cd17eb60:
msgid "[_L_] How are we going to pay it when we already have Dad's debts to deal with?"
msgstr "[_L_] Ako to zaplatíme, keď už máme otcovské dlhy, aby sme sa s ním vysporiadali?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21289 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_71ca139d:
msgid "[_M_] I don't know."
msgstr "-Neviem."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21292 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_53212abd:
msgid "[_L_] You don't know? How can you not know?"
msgstr "-Ty to nevieš? Ako to, že nevieš?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21293 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_3301e5d9:
msgid "[_L_] The mobs going kill us!"
msgstr "[L_] Moby nás zabijú!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21294 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_ef0236d9:
msgid "[_R_] Lauren, calm down, okay? We'll figure something out."
msgstr "-Lauren, upokoj sa, dobre? Niečo zistíme."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21295 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_645e5ff5:
msgid "[_S_] I can help. I've been saving all my pay from the club, and maybe Mr. DeCapo will let me pick up some extra shifts?"
msgstr "[_S_] Môžem vám pomôcť. Zachraňoval som všetku výplatu od klubu, a možno mi pán DeCapo dovolí, aby som si vyzdvihol ďalšie smeny?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21296 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_26bb9677:
msgid "[_M_] No!"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21297 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_0e3273a2:
msgid "[_M_] That money is for college. You need to get back to design school so you can escape all this."
msgstr "Tie peniaze sú na výšku. Musíš sa vrátiť do dizajnskej školy, aby si mohol uniknúť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21298 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_b2ab9a00:
msgid "[_S_] Then how are we going to..."
msgstr "[_S_] Potom, ako sa ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21299 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_08b55e30:
msgid "[_L_] Yeah! How are we going to not get murdered?"
msgstr "[_ L_] Áno! Ako to, že sa nechystáme zabiť?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21302 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_c1be3483:
msgid "[_M_] I said, I don't know!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Povedal som, že neviem!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21303 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_dc9b4f74:
msgid "[_M_] Stop talking about getting murdered! I don't know how I'm going to fix it, but I will!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Prestaňte hovoriť o tom, ako sa vraždí! Neviem, ako to napravím, ale urobím to!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21304 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_49e94d7d:
msgid "[_M_] I just need some time to think!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Len potrebujem nejaký čas na premýšľanie!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21305 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_973ae88c:
msgid "[_R_] Mom, take it easy..."
msgstr "Mami, kľakni si."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21306 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_2fed90a6:
msgid "[_R_] My business is doing really well... If everyone helped out at my studio, I'm sure we could..."
msgstr "[_R_] Moje podnikanie sa naozaj robí dobre ... Ak by všetci pomohli v mojom štúdiu, som si istý, že by sme mohli ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21307 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_26bb9677_1:
msgid "[_M_] No!"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21310 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_0e147b20:
msgid "[_M_] I will handle it. Don't involve your sisters in this anymore than you already have."
msgstr "[_ M_] Ja sa postarám o to. Nezapájajte sa do tohto procesu už viac, než ste už mali."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21311 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_a9026e51:
msgid "[_R_] But, Mom..."
msgstr "[_ R_] Ale, mami ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21312 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_f104711c:
msgid "[_M_] I said, no!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Povedal som, nie!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21313 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_85456a66:
msgid "[_M_] I'm your mother. This is my burden not yours."
msgstr "[_ M_] Ja som vaša matka. Toto nie je moje bremeno."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21314 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_84e20f91:
msgid "[_M_] {b}I{/b} will handle this."
msgstr "[_M_] {b}I {/b} to zvládne."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21315 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_9acb6ba1:
msgid "[_M_] {b}I{/b} will find a way to pay Mr. DeCapo."
msgstr "[_M_] {b}I {/b} nájde spôsob, ako zaplatiť pána DeCapo."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21316 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_7ce0505e:
msgid "[_M_] Lauren, you and [ryan] need to focus on passing your exams and graduating high school. Sidney, you need to look for a respectable job and focus on getting back into design school."
msgstr "Lauren, ty a [ryan] sa musíte zamerať na absolvovanie skúšky a absolvovanie strednej školy. Sidney, musíš sa pozrieť na slušnú prácu a sústrediť sa na to, ako sa dostať späť do dizajnovej školy."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21317 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_0e9cf35b:
msgid "[_M_] Now go back to bed, all of you."
msgstr "[_ M_] Teraz sa vráťte do postele, všetci."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21320 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_a2b80596:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}...{/i}"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21321 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_d366d3b2:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}How did this night go so wrong, so fast?...{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Ako sa táto noc stalo tak zle, tak rýchlo? ... {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21325 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_43091f1e:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I know Mom's putting on a brave face for us, but she was barely keeping it together. This is too much for her to take on alone.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Viem, že mama nám dáva statočný tvár, ale sotva ju držala spolu. Je to pre ňu príliš veľa na to, aby sa sama o sebe postarala. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21326 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_6bb804f9:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I thought Mom had started to see me as a man. Her man...{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Myslel som, že mama začala vidieť ma ako muža. Jej muž ... {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21327 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_76067d3b:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}But tonight, I went back to being the little boy she needs to protect.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Ale dnes večer som sa vrátil, aby som bol ten malý chlapec, ktorého potrebuje chrániť. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21328 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_dbbfc7f9:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I have to show her I can be the guy... the man she counts on! Now, more than ever, I need to prove she can depend on me.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}musím jej ukázať, že môžem byť ten, na ktorom sa spoliehá! Teraz, viac ako inokedy, musím dokázať, že to môže závisieť na mne. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21329 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_e3233cc8:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}But how?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Ale ako? {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21330 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_632747d3:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Aunt Cami let Joey loan her so much money before she lost it all. This won't be like Dad's debts, where Joey lets us get away with only making payments on the interest.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}teta Cami nech Joey pôžička jej toľko peňazí, než sa stratila to všetko. Nebude to ako otcove dlhy, kde nám Joey nechá odísť len s platmi na úrok. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21331 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_131a6656:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}He's going to use this to force Mom deeper into his clutches. If I don't do something, Mom will end up like Candy.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}To bude použiť, aby mama hlbšie do svojich pazúrií. Ak niečo neurobím, mama skončí ako Candy. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21332 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_e2ebf4ce:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Just another one of Joey DeCapo's whores.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Len ďalší z kuriev Joeyho DeCapa. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21333 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_53c73fe0:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}My photoshoots made good money, but I've pretty much wrapped each of them up. I'm going to start losing subscribers if I don't put out something new.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Moje fotostrety zarobili dobré peniaze, ale ja som ich každý z nich zabalil. Začnem strápať predplatiteľov, ak nevydáme niečo nové. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21334 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_bc27a031:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}To make the kind of money we'll need, it'll take more than another softcore shoot. I'll need to do something big. Something that would get a lot of online attention.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Ak chcete zarobiť peniaze, ktoré budeme potrebovať, to bude trvať viac ako ďalšie softcore strieľať. Budem musieť urobiť niečo veľké. Niečo, na čo by sa venovala veľa online pozornosti. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21335 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_df18cbbc:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}The Perry Hotter set with Mom and Megan did really well. So, something with two girls would be best.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Perry Hotter nastavený s mamou a Megan urobil naozaj dobre. Tak, niečo s dvoma dievčami by bolo najlepšie. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21336 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_0ebff335:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Lauren and Mandy's Instaslam certainly got big quick with their lezzy pictures. Girl on girl is always very popular, but what really got their subscriber count to take off, was them being cousins.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Lauren a Mandy je Instaslam určite dostal veľký rýchly s ich lezzy obrázky. Dievča na dievča je vždy veľmi populárne, ale to, čo naozaj dostal ich počet odberateľov, aby sa vyzlial, bolo to byť bratranci. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21337 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_5a0ca020:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}An incestuous lesbian shoot with Lauren and Mandy would be perfect, but even if I could get Lauren to agree to do it, Mandy's gone now.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Necestný lesbické strieľať s Lauren a Mandy by bolo perfektné, ale aj keby som mohol dostať Lauren, aby sa dohodli, že to urobiť, Mandy je preč. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21338 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_d7351c47:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Mom would probably be really mad anyways, if I used any of the girls behind her back. After that speech, she's going to insist on being involved in whatever I come up with.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Mama by sa asi naozaj zblázni, ak by som za jej chrbtom použil niektorú z dievčat. Po tomto prejave bude trvať na tom, že bude zaplečená do toho, s čím prídem."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21339 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_b749df57:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}So, a shoot with Mom and someone else would be best, but who should I have with her?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Takže strieľať s mamou a niekto iný by bolo najlepšie, ale kto by mal mať s ňou? {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21340 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_21ec90af:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Maybe Megan? She'd be up for it, no question... And they've already done one photoshoot together.{/i}"
msgstr "[_ RT_] {i}Možno Megan? Ona by bola pre to, bez pochýb ... A už urobili jednu fotku spolu. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21341 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_628b1f96:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Shit. With how well the incest angle worked for Lauren and Mandy's InstaSlam account, I really think that's the way to go. Megan and Mom don't look anything like each other though. No one's going to believe they're related.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Do riti. S tým, ako presne ten najmenší uhol pracoval pre Lauren a Mandy's InstaSlam účet, naozaj si myslím, že je to spôsob, ako ísť. Megan a mama sa na seba nepozerajú ako na seba. Nikto neverí, že sú príbuzné. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21342 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_d877be7c_1:
msgid "[_R_] {i}(sigh){/i}"
msgstr "[_R_] {i}(sigh) {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21343 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_15480b02:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Well, there's no point in just standing around. I can work out the details later. For now, I should go talk to Mom and make sure she knows she can count on me to keep us safe.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}No, nie je tu bod, v ktorom len stojím okolo. Podrobnosti si môžem vypracovať neskôr. Teraz by som sa mala porozprávať s mamou a uistiť sa, že vie, že sa na mňa môže spoľahnúť, aby sme boli v bezpečí. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21344 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_05_c4e7f950:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Maybe I should check on Lauren and Sidney first? They both looked pretty shaken up.{/i}"
msgstr "[_ RT_] {i}Možno by som mal najprv skontrolovať Lauren a Sidneyho? Obaja vyzerali celkom otrasený. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21353 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_fc17ce9e:
msgid "[_C_] Please, Brittney!... It would only be for a couple weeks until we can find something more permanant."
msgstr "-Prosím, Brittney! ... Bolo by to len na pár týždňov, kým nenájdeme niečo trvalejšie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21354 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_84d0a507:
msgid "[_X_] {i}(Voice muffled over intercom){/i} That doesn't change the fact that you're the wife and daughter of a known fugitive."
msgstr "[_X_] {i}(Hlas muffled over intercom) {/i} To nemení fakt, že ste manželka a dcéra známeho utečenca."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21355 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_07c3a6b8:
msgid "[_X_] The PTA elections are coming up, how am I going to keep my spot as president if I'm harboring terrorists."
msgstr "[_X_] Prichádzajú voľby PTA, ako budem držať svoje miesto ako prezident, ak som uvrdený teroristami."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21358 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9f85b907:
msgid "[_C_] Oh, we're terrorists now? Fuck you Brittney!"
msgstr "[_C_] Oh, sme teroristi teraz? Pojeb sa Brittney!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21359 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_b99736a7:
msgid "[_C_] When your mom had that stroke, and you had to rush to be by her side, who took care of your little Chelsie?"
msgstr "[_C_] Keď mala tvoja mama tú mŕtvicu, a musel si sa ponáhľať, aby si bol po jej boku, ktorý sa postaral o tvoju malú Chelsie?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21360 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_3f5c5177:
msgid "[_X_] Your nanny Cindy did! It wasn't you. And we paid her extra since she was watching both our girls."
msgstr "[_X_] Vaša pestúnska Cindy! To nie si ty. A zaplatili sme jej, odkedy sledovala obe naše dievčatá."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21361 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_eee29b6d:
msgid "[_C_] Yeah, but I'm still the one who made that happen! She stayed at our house, ate our food. I could have forbid Cindy from watching Chelsie."
msgstr "[_ C_] Áno, ale ja som stále ten, kto to urobil! Zostala v našom dome, jedli naše jedlo. Mohol by som predpovedať Cindy, aby som sledoval Chelsie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21362 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_ebc07522:
msgid "[_X_] And we really appreciated it, but this is much different."
msgstr "[_X_] A my sme to naozaj ocenili, ale to je oveľa odlišné."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21363 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e4eb81ac:
msgid "[_X_] I'm sorry, I just can't expose my family to the horrors of organized crime."
msgstr "[_X_] Je mi ľúto, ale nemôžem vystaviť svoju rodinu hrôzy organizovaného zločinu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21364 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6fab91fa:
msgid "[_C_] We wouldn't..."
msgstr "[_ C_] My by sme ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21365 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d3316366:
msgid "[_X_] I'm going back to bed... Goodbye, Camille! {i}(Click){/i}"
msgstr "[_X_] Idem späť do postele ... Dovidenia, Camille! {i}(Kliknite) {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21366 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e547f083:
msgid "[_C_] Aaahhh!!!"
msgstr "[_C_] Aaahhh !!!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21369 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_640a690f:
msgid "[_C_] After everything we've done for these snobs, they don't want to touch us with a ten foot pole."
msgstr "[_ C_] Potom, čo sme urobili pre tieto snobi, nechcú sa nás dotknúť s desaťmetrový pól."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21370 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_47d1eb62:
msgid "[_MD_] Who's next on our list?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Kto je ďalší na našom zozname?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21371 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_06a04f28:
msgid "[_C_] That's it... I'm out of friends."
msgstr "[_ C_] To je to ... Som mimo priateľov."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21372 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5b551849:
msgid "[_C_] Eleven houses, eleven rejections."
msgstr "Jedenásť domov, jedenásť remien."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21373 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_364430ca:
msgid "[_MD_] Then... Can we please just go back to Aunt [mom_name]'s?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Potom ... Môžeme sa vrátiť k tete [mom_name] ' s?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21376 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_38806f7a:
msgid "[_C_] Are you fucking out of your mind!?"
msgstr "Zbláznil si sa z hlavy?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21377 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_adeb2ad2:
msgid "[_C_] After everything they've done to us!?"
msgstr "[_ C_] Po všetkom, čo nám urobili!?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21378 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_7be5c6ed:
msgid "[_C_] It felt so good to finally tell my sister off, tell her what I think of that God aweful son of hers..."
msgstr "[_ C_] Bolo to tak dobré konečne povedať mojej sestre, povedať jej to, čo si myslím o tom, že Boží syn hriešy ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21379 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5d90219d:
msgid "[_C_] And you want me to take it all back? Beg her to let us come back?..."
msgstr "[_ C_] A chcete, aby som to všetko vzal späť? Prosiť, aby sme sa vrátili?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21380 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d1e189ab:
msgid "[_C_] Uh uh... No way!"
msgstr "[_C_] Uh ... V žiadnom prípade!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21381 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_eb56ddad:
msgid "[_MD_] Sorry... I shouldn't have suggested that."
msgstr "[_MD_] Prepáčte ... To som nemal naznačiť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21384 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d1bc117e:
msgid "[_MD_] But, where are we going to go? We don't even have money for a cheap motel."
msgstr "[_MD_] Ale kam ideme? Nemáme ani peniaze na lacný motel."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21385 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_a1963be1:
msgid "[_MD_] We can't even drive very far before we run out of gas."
msgstr "[_ MD_] Nemôžeme ani jazdiť veľmi ďaleko, než sa nám vybehne z plynu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21386 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_a74b5b4f:
msgid "[_C_] We've just got to figure out something for tonight. We'll have all day tomorrow to find something more permanant."
msgstr "[_ C_] Musíme prísť na niečo na dnešný večer. Zajtra budeme mať celý deň, aby sme našli niečo trvalejšie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21392 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_fc48da1a:
msgid "[_MD_] Oh, no... You're kidding me! We're going to sleep in the park?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Oh, nie ... Robíš si zo mňa srandu! Budeme spať v parku?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21393 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_49dc9c53:
msgid "[_MD_] Mom... It's against the law to sleep in the park."
msgstr "[_MD_] Mami ... Je to proti zákonu, aby spal v parku."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21394 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_4ce2fd4e:
msgid "[_C_] Do you have a better idea?"
msgstr "-Máš lepší nápad?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21395 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_baeedf73:
msgid "[_MDT_] {i}Yeah, Aunt [mom_name]'s, but Mom will cut my head off if I suggest that again.{/i}"
msgstr "[_MDT_] {i}Áno, teta [mom_name] ' s, ale mama odstrihne moju hlavu, ak to navrhujem znova. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21398 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_1c7c6958:
msgid "[_C_] If we park behind these bushes, we'll be pretty hard to spot."
msgstr "[_C_] Ak zaparujeme za týmito kríkmi, budeme dosť ťažké na mieste."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21399 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_dfb5fdec:
