# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21523 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_cda462fd:
msgid "[_P_] Camille?... Mandy?... Are you both all right?"
msgstr "[_ P_] Camille? ... Mandy? Ste obaja v poriadku?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21524 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f2434926:
msgid "[_C_] How do you know our names?"
msgstr "[_C_] Ako poznáte naše mená?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21525 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d9a0ba07:
msgid "[_P_] Because I've been following you."
msgstr "[_ P_] Pretože som ťa sledovala."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21526 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9a598886:
msgid "[_P_] Joey DeCapo was worried you might be a flight risk, so he called my Lieutenant, who radio'd me and told me to drop everything I was doing, to come babysit you."
msgstr "Joey DeCapo sa obával, že by si mohol byť letový risk, tak zavolal môjmu poručíku, ktorý mi volal rádio a povedal mi, aby som sa pustil všetko, čo som robil, aby som ťa postrádal."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21529 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6158d10a:
msgid "[_C_] Then it's true?"
msgstr "[_C_] Potom je to pravda?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21530 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f3afc1e5:
msgid "[_C_] The police in this city are on the DeCapo's payroll?"
msgstr "Polícia v tomto meste je na výplatnej listinke Dekapu?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21531 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_c2210e34:
msgid "[_P_] No, Ma'am, not all of us. Just the ones of us who matter."
msgstr "-Nie, pani, nie všetci. Len tí z nás, ktorí na tom záleží."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21532 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_962d70e9:
msgid "[_C_] I can't believe this! You should be chasing down that filthy pervert, not obeying some criminal's orders!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Nemôžem tomu uveriť! Mal by si sa naháňať do tej špinavej pervertu, neposlúchať kriminálne rozkazy!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21533 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_73840086:
msgid "[_P_] That \"filthy pervert\" is a war hero!"
msgstr "[_ P_] Že \"špinavý pervert\" je vojnový hrdina!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21534 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_7c56cc12:
msgid "[_P_] Haha... I heard his retirement home sent him to the hospital for a vasectomy, since his personal caretakers keep getting pregnant."
msgstr "[_ P_] Haha ... Počul som, že jeho domov ho poslal do nemocnice na vasektómiu, pretože jeho osobná opatrovateľka stále otehotnela."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21537 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_4f8c7ec8:
msgid "[_P_] Not against their wills or anything! I guess he's just super charismatic when he's on his meds."
msgstr "[_ P_] Nie proti ich závesom, ani nič! Myslím, že je len super charizmatický, keď je na jeho lieky."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21538 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_c0d5b901:
msgid "[_P_] Anyways, I guess he had a weird reaction to the anestesia, bolted out of his bed right before the doctor could make an incision, and he's been on the run since this morning."
msgstr "[_ P_] Kedysi, myslím, že mal divnú reakciu na anestesiu, bolted z jeho postele tesne predtým, než doktor mohol urobiť rez, a on bol na úteku od dnešného rána."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21539 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e0367fc7:
msgid "[_P_] He'll be caught though, and brought back to a place where he's respected, and not called filthy, or perverted by ignorant nobodys."
msgstr "[_ P_] Bude chystať aj keď, a vrátil sa na miesto, kde je rešpektovaný, a nie povolal špinavé, alebo zvrhne ignorantské nobodys."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21540 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_bb144871:
msgid "[_C_] I didn't mean..."
msgstr "[_ C_] Ja som nemyslel ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21541 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_ea89ab85:
msgid "[_P_] And can I give you some advice?"
msgstr "[_ P_] A môžem vám dať nejaké rady?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21542 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_550f380c:
msgid "[_P_] Don't fuck with Joey DeCapo."
msgstr "Neserte na Joeyho DeCapa."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21543 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_81d7e069:
msgid "[_P_] If you're in deep with him, do everything in your power to make it right."
msgstr "[_ P_] Ak ste v hlbokom s ním, urobiť všetko, čo je vo svojej moci, aby to správne."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21544 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9c29a96b:
msgid "[_P_] People who cross him seem to find themselves having unfortunate accidents, if you know what I mean."
msgstr "Ľudia, ktorí ho križujú, sa zdajú byť nešťastní, ak viete, čo tým myslím."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21545 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5d779317:
msgid "[_C_] I'm sure I don't!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Som si istý, že nie!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21546 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_ffb0b66b:
msgid "[_P_] The last district attorney who tried to go after him ended up falling out the window of his office high rise."
msgstr "Posledný okresný prokurátor, ktorý sa snažil ísť po ňom, skončil vypadať z okna svojho úradu vysokého vzostup."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21547 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_2830a37c:
msgid "[_P_] Witnesses claim he tripped."
msgstr "Svedkovia tvrdia, že sa ztrial."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21548 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_c6657359:
msgid "[_P_] And if you think he's not going to waste his breath on a nobody like you, forget about it."
msgstr "[_P_] A ak si myslíte, že nebude strápať dych na nikoho, ako ste vy, zabudni na to."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21549 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_36005584:
msgid "[_P_] I knew a drug dealer who kept shorting his payments to Joey for just five dollars per transaction. He ended up only shorting him like a hundred bucks before Joey noticed."
msgstr "[_ P_] Vedel som, že drogový díler, ktorý stále skrachoval svoje platby pre Joeyho za iba päť dolárov na jednu transakciu. Skončil mu len tak, že ho skrášil ako sto babiek, než si to Joey všimol."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21550 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6aff6bd5:
msgid "[_P_] He ended up drowning in his own bathtub... Over a hundred bucks."
msgstr "Nakoniec sa topil vo vani vo vani. Za sto babiek."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21551 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_48b03ad3:
msgid "[_P_] How much do you owe him?"
msgstr "[_ P_] Koľko mu dlhujete?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21552 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_1780d274:
msgid "[_P_] A little more than that, right?"
msgstr "[_ P_] O niečo viac, však?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21553 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d27a11e1:
msgid "[_P_] I'm sorry that I have to be the bearer of bad news, but I'd hate to find a couple beautiful ladies like yourselves in one of those unfortunate accidents."
msgstr "[_ P_] Je mi ľúto, že musím byť nositeľa zlých správ, ale nerád by som našiel pár krásnych dám, ako ste vy, v jednej z tých nešťastných nehôd."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21554 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d59fa068:
msgid "[_P_] So... Are you going to be a further problem, or can I go help my fellow officer catch Mr. Peterson?"
msgstr "[_ P_] Takže ... Budete ďalší problém, alebo môžem ísť pomôcť môjmu spolupracovníkovi chytiť pána Petersona?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21555 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_83596022:
msgid "[_C_] Uhhh... No... We won't cause any further problems, officer. I'm going to make things right with Mr. DeCapo."
msgstr "[_C_] Uhhh ... Nie ... Neprídeme o ďalšie problémy, dôstojník. Spravím veci priamo s pánom DeCapom."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21556 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_b549fda8:
msgid "[_P_] Good choice!"
msgstr "[_ P_] Dobrý výber!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21557 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_7c64bc0b:
msgid "[_P_] And good luck!"
msgstr "A veľa šťastia!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21560 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_ca9be73e:
msgid "[_P_] {i}(Distant voice){/i} I saw him run into those trees by the pond."
msgstr "[_P_] {i}(Vzdialenský hlas) {/i} Videl som ho behať do týchto stromov pri rybníku."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21563 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_8e96a2d4:
msgid "[_MD_] Dammit, Mom!"
msgstr "-Sakra, mami!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21564 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_42438888:
msgid "[_MD_] Why did you get into debt with the mafia?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Prečo ste sa dostali do dlhov s mafiou?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21565 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_048b5d8b:
msgid "[_C_] I'm sorry, baby... I didn't realize how big of a mess I was getting us into."
msgstr "Je mi to ľúto, zlatko ... Neuvedomila som si, aký veľký bordek som dostal do toho."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21566 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_3f43170e:
msgid "[_C_] I'm so sorry I made you go through everything we just went through tonight."
msgstr "Je mi to tak ľúto, že som ťa urobil cez všetko, čo sme práve prešli dnes večer."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21567 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_7973717b:
msgid "[_MD_] Fucking [ryan]! I told him not to let you get into trouble!"
msgstr "[_ MD_] Zasraný [ryan]! Povedal som mu, aby ti nedovolil dostať sa do problémov!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21568 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_c7941187:
msgid "[_C_] ...."
msgstr "[_C_] ...."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21569 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_81fd22fd:
msgid "[_C_] He tried really hard to stop me, baby... I got drunk and refused to listen to him."
msgstr "[_ C_] Snažil sa ma naozaj tvrdo zastaviť, baby ... Opil som sa a odmietol ho počúvať."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21570 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_54ec7700:
msgid "[_C_] He's one of the worst human beings I know, but this one wasn't his fault."
msgstr "Je to jedna z najhorších ľudských bytostí, ktorú poznám, ale táto nebola jeho vina."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21571 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_0744c59a:
msgid "[_MD_] Really? He tried really hard?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Naozaj? Skúšal to vážne?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21572 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d0652804:
msgid "[_C_] He did."
msgstr "[_ C_] On to urobil."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21573 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_a74b9874:
msgid "[_MD_] You need to give him more of a chance... He's not as bad as you think he is."
msgstr "[_MD_] Musíte mu dať väčšiu šancu ... Nie je taký zlý, ako si myslíš, že je."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21574 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_cdfcdf8f:
msgid "[_C_] I'm sure he's much worse, but I'll try not to be such a bitch to him in the future."
msgstr "[_ C_] Som si istý, že je oveľa horší, ale ja sa snažiť, aby som byť taký suka k nemu v budúcnosti."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21575 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_eaa1a5e4:
msgid "[_MD_] Does that mean we're going back to Aunt [mom_name]'s?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Znamená to, že sa vraciame späť do tety [mom_name] ' s?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21576 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d1424cc2:
msgid "[_C_] Yes, baby."
msgstr "-Áno, zlatko."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21577 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_aad6e406:
msgid "[_C_] I'll try to make things right with [mom_name]."
msgstr "[_ C_] Budem sa snažiť, aby veci správne s [mom_name]."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21578 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f964c9c3:
msgid "[_C_] And you called me out on a lot of my shit, so I'll try to work on that too."
msgstr "[_ C_] A nazvali ste ma na kopci mojich sračkov, takže sa pokúsim pracovať na tom taky."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21579 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_a9d90ec4:
msgid "[_MD_] Really?"
msgstr "[_MD_] Naozaj?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21580 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_ccd228cb:
msgid "[_C_] Promise."
msgstr "[_ C_] Sľúb."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21584 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_aaea6b00:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Fuck... my mind is racing! How am I going to get any sleep after everything that happened tonight?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Kurva ... moja myseľ je závodná! Ako sa dostanem k spánku po všetkom, čo sa dnes večer stalo?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21585 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_abc0f05f:
msgid "{i}\"Sound of front door opening\"{/i}"
msgstr "{i}\"Sound of front door opening\" {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21586 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_a81220a2:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Is that the front door?{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Je to predné dvierka? {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21587 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_75ce42ad:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}I'd better check it out.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Radšej by som to mal skontrolovať. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21590 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_8ffcbce2:
msgid "[_R_] {i}(Whispering){/i} Oh, thank God!... You guys came back!"
msgstr "[_R_] {i}(Whispering) {/i} Oh, ďakujem Bohu! ... Vrátili ste sa!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21593 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_58c2c9dc:
msgid "[_MD_] {i}(Whispering){/i} I know she's a bitch, but try not to go too hard on her... She's had rough night."
msgstr "[_MD_] {i}(Whispering) {/i} Viem, že je to suka, ale snaž sa na ňu neísť príliš tvrdo ... Mala drsnú noc."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21594 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f854a371:
msgid "[_MD_] {i}I'm going to go pass out in Lauren's bed, right now.{/i}"
msgstr "[_MD_] {i}Teraz prejdem v posteli Lauren, práve teraz. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21597 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5f9b772e:
msgid "...."
msgstr "...."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21600 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_145446eb:
msgid "[_C_] {i}(Whispering){/i} I'm sorry, [ryan]."
msgstr "[_C_] {i}(Whispering) {/i} Je mi ľúto, [ryan]."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21601 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_854f6647:
msgid "[_C_] I really fucked up big time."
msgstr "[_ C_] Ja som naozaj pretiahol veľký čas."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21602 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d02053f6:
msgid "[_C_] This is all my fault, and I wish like hell that I had listened to you at the club."
msgstr "[_ C_] To je všetko moja chyba, a želám si peklo, ktoré som si vypočul v klube."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21603 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_dd18a9ba:
msgid "[_C_] I don't know how, but I'm going to try to do everything I can to pay back Joey."
msgstr "Neviem ako, ale pokúsim sa urobiť všetko, čo môžem, aby som sa vrátil Joeymu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21604 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_b2373721:
msgid "[_R_] I'm just glad you came back."
msgstr "[_ R_] Som rád, že ste sa vrátili."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21605 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d379ee05:
msgid "[_R_] I know we don't get along, but we're family, and I was worried about you two."
msgstr "[_ R_] Viem, že sa nepoznáme, ale sme rodina, a bála som sa o vás dvoch."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21608 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_c1f6fd5b:
msgid "[_C_] Do you think [mom_name] will let us stay?"
msgstr "[_ C_] Myslíte si, že [mom_name] nám dovolí zostať?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21609 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_1234702d:
msgid "[_R_] Honestly, I'm not sure."
msgstr "[_ R_] Úprimne, nie som si istý."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21610 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_caee2b8a:
msgid "[_R_] Judging by her mood when she went to bed, You might need to get on your knees and beg."
msgstr "[R_] Judging, keď išla do postele, mohla by si sa na kolená a prosiť."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21611 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_ee823319:
msgid "[_C_] I'm honestly not above doing that right now."
msgstr "[_ C_] Ja som úprimne povedané, nie je vyššie, že práve teraz."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21612 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6a3cf983:
msgid "[_C_] I'll do whatever it takes."
msgstr "[_ C_] Ja urobím, čo bude treba."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21613 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5ac92838:
msgid "[_R_] That's good... A little humility will go a long way."
msgstr "[_ R_] To je dobré ... Trochu pokory bude trvať dlhú cestu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21614 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_b2411f21:
msgid "[_R_] And for fuck's sake, you're family. She might not forgive you right away, but I'm sure she'll get over it eventually."
msgstr "[_ R_] A pre boha, ste rodina. Možno ti neodpustí hneď, ale som si istý, že sa o to nakoniec dostane."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21617 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6f84b1bb:
msgid "[_C_] Oh, God!"
msgstr "Oh, Bože!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21618 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_7d386364:
msgid "[_M_] {i}(Whispering){/i}What the hell are you doing back here!?"
msgstr "[_M_] {i}(Whispering) {/i} Čo tu do pekla robíte!?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21621 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d4bbabd3:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Fuck... Here we go again!{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Kurva ... Ideme znova! {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21622 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_0d314094:
msgid "[_M_] You've got some nerve to walk into my house again!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Vy máte nejaký nervy, aby ste sa opäť dostali do môjho domu!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21623 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_00e1aafd:
msgid "[_M_] After everything you did to us... After everything you said to us!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Potom, čo ste nám urobili všetko, čo ste urobili ... Po všetkom, čo si nám povedal!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21626 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f696da3e:
msgid "[_M_] You are by far the most selfish person I've ever met in my entire life!"
msgstr "[_M_] Ste zďaleka najsebecký človek, aký som kedy stretol v celom mojom živote!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21627 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f094f3b2:
msgid "[_M_] Only you would get in debt to the mafia for something as stupid as gambling, and then think it's someone else's fault!"
msgstr "[_M_] Len by ste sa dostali do dlhu na mafiu za niečo ako hlúpe, ako hazardné hry, a potom si myslím, že je to niekto iný chyba!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21628 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_753c144c:
msgid "[_M_] Why you think you're better than anybody else is completely beyond m..."
msgstr "[_ M_] Prečo si myslíte, že ste lepší ako ktokoľvek iný je úplne mimo m ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21631 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f3d13339:
msgid "[_C_] I'm so sorry!"
msgstr "Je mi to tak ľúto!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21632 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9e2b32c9:
msgid "[_C_] Please, please, please, please forgive me!"
msgstr "[_C_] Prosím, prosím, prosím, prosím, odpusť mi!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21633 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_4e3e980d:
msgid "[_M_] What's happening right now?"
msgstr "Čo sa deje práve teraz?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21636 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_b19334f9:
msgid "[_C_] I took your hospitality for granted, and I felt angry that had to rely on you instead of feeling gratitude like I should have."
msgstr "[_ C_] vzal som vašu pohostinnosť za samozrejmosť, a cítil som naštvaný, že musel spoliehať na vás namiesto toho, aby sa cítil vďačnosť, ako by som mal mať."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21637 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_67fecb6d:
msgid "[_C_] I've contributed very little to help our situation, and complained about the few things that were required of me."
msgstr "[_ C_] Ja som prispel veľmi málo, aby som pomohol našej situácii, a sťažoval sa na niektoré veci, ktoré boli od mňa požadované."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21640 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6f27d549:
msgid "[_C_] I've been rude and derisive about your weekend job that you've only ever done to keep the mafia from hurting you and your family."
msgstr "[_ C_] Bol som hrubý a derisive o vašej víkendovej práci, ktorú ste kedy urobili len preto, aby mafii ublížilo tebe a vašej rodine."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21643 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_af822dd2:
msgid "[_M_] {i}(Silently mouthing the words){/i} What is happening?"
msgstr "[_M_] {i}(Tiché ústa, slová) {/i} Čo sa deje?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21644 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e29a9dd6:
msgid "[_C_] I know I don't deserve your forgiveness, but my daughter loves you and your family."
msgstr "[_C_] Viem, že si nezaslúžim tvoje odpustenie, ale moja dcéra miluje teba a tvoju rodinu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21645 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f6e6c445:
msgid "[_C_] She wants to be here more than anywhere else."
msgstr "Chce tu byť viac ako kdekoľvek inde."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21648 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_528f3280:
msgid "[_C_] She's an amazing girl who doesn't deserve to be punished for the sins of her mother."
msgstr "[_ C_] Je to úžasné dievča, ktoré si nezaslúži byť potrestaný za hriechy svojej matky."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21649 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f15f9542:
msgid "[_C_] You have every right to keep her and send me away, but please let me stay here with my girl so we don't have to be seperated!"
msgstr "[_ C_] Máte plné právo držať ju a poslať ma preč, ale prosím, nechajte ma tu s mojím dievčaťa, takže nie je potrebné byť seperated!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21652 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_834a7744:
msgid "[_C_] As terrible of a mother as I've been, I still want to..."
msgstr "[_C_] Ako hrozná matka, ako som bol, stále chcem ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21653 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6bfef7e3:
msgid "[_M_] Okay, Camille... That's enough."
msgstr "-Dobre, Camille ... To stačí."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21654 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_c1afff59:
msgid "[_M_] We can talk about this more in the morning."
msgstr "[_ M_] Môžeme o tom hovoriť viac ráno."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21655 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6040aa34:
msgid "[_C_] Does that mean we can stay?"
msgstr "Znamená to, že môžeme zostať?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21656 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_8494fbc0:
msgid "[_M_] For now, but we've got a lot of stuff we need to work out."
msgstr "[_ M_] Pre teraz, ale máme veľa vecí, musíme pracovať von."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21657 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9606aeb9:
msgid "[_M_] I don't want you sleeping in my room with me anymore, but you're welcome to sleep on the couch."
msgstr "Nechcem, aby si už so mnou spal v mojej izbe, ale ty si vítaná, že si na gauči vyspala."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21658 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_96170736:
msgid "[_C_] That's more than I deserve. Thank you!"
msgstr "[_C_] To je viac, než si zaslúžim. Ďakujem vám!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21662 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_af04a4bc:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}That went different and better than I was expecting.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}To bolo iné a lepšie, než som očakával. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21663 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_641bff83:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Still, I should probably go check on Mom and make sure she's okay.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Napriek tomu by som asi mala ísť skontrolovať mamu a uistiť sa, že je v poriadku. {/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21666 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_6c13d057:
msgid "[_M_] {i}(Muttering under breath){/i} God damn you [dad_name]! God damn you Camille! Why do I have to pay for all your sins?!"
msgstr "[_M_] {i}(Muttering pod dych) {/i} Boh ťa sakra [dad_name]! Do čerta s tebou Camille! Prečo by som mal platiť za všetky vaše hriechy?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21667 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_54d6f3d7:
msgid "[_M_] {i}God damn you [mom_name]! Why can't you keep it together!?"
msgstr "[_M_] {i}Boh ťa dočerta [mom_name]! Prečo to neudržíš spolu?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21668 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e92298c8:
msgid "[_RT_] {i}Uh, oh... She doesn't look like she's doing well at all.{/i}"
msgstr "[_RT_] {i}Uh, oh ... Nevyzerá na to, že sa jej darí dobre."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21669 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9eaf5062:
msgid "[_R_] Mom?"
msgstr "[_R_] Mama?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21672 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d2b738c4:
msgid "[_M_] [ryan]!... You scared me!... I didn't hear you come in."
msgstr "[_ M_] [ryan]! ... Vystrašil si ma! Nepočula som, že si prišiel."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21673 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_34c240cd:
msgid "[_R_] Sorry, your door was open."
msgstr "Prepáč, tvoje dvere boli otvorené."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21674 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_811c36de:
msgid "[_M_] Huh... I thought I'd shut and locked it."
msgstr "[_M_] Hm ... Myslela som si, že to zavriem a zamknem."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21675 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5f47a735:
msgid "[_R_] Mom... You look like you're really struggling."
msgstr "Mami ... Vyzeráš, akoby si naozaj bojoval."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21676 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_ad24cf73:
msgid "[_M_] No shit?"
msgstr "-To nie je nič?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21679 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_0b532497:
msgid "[_M_] Of course I'm struggling!"
msgstr "[_M_] Samozrejme, že som bojoval!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21680 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_2474e9d9:
msgid "[_M_] Since [dad_name] went to prison, at any given moment I'm just a breath away from a nervous breakdown."
msgstr "[_ M_] Od [dad_name] šiel do väzenia, v každom danom okamihu som len dych preč od nervovej zrúti."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21681 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_a0a43abe:
msgid "[_M_] All the weight he was carrying was added to the weight I already had and then tripled with the weight of being investigated by the FBI and extorted by the Mob."
msgstr "[_M_] Všetka váha, ktorú niesol, bola pridaná k hmotnosti, ktorú som už mal a potom strojnásobil s hmotnosťou vyšetrovanej FBI a vydieraná v Mob."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21682 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5d26f8dd:
msgid "[_M_] I'm doing everything I can to keep our family together, hell, at this point I'm doing everything I can just to keep us from getting murdered."
msgstr "[_M_] Ja robím všetko, čo môžem, aby naša rodina spolu, peklo, v tomto bode robím všetko, čo môžem len, aby nás od toho, aby nás zavraždili."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21685 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_48e4c3ae:
msgid "[_M_] And I realized tonight that I've been relying on you too much."
msgstr "[_ M_] A dnes večer som si uvedomil, že sa spolieham na vás príliš veľa."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21686 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_17019e3d:
msgid "[_M_] By letting you carry so much responsibility, I've robbed you of the final years of your youth."
msgstr "Ak dovolíte niesť toľko zodpovednosti, vylúpil som vás z posledných rokov svojej mladej mládeže."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21689 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_8a752805:
msgid "[_M_] By being so vulnerable and letting my guard down, I allowed myself to rob you of your innocence."
msgstr "Tým, že som bol taký zraniteľný a sklamal moju stráž, dovolil som ti okradnúť vašu nevinu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21690 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9e4331f2:
msgid "[_M_] I don't think I can ever forgive myself for being the worst mother ever!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Nemyslím si, že by som mohol nikdy odpustiť sám za to, že najhoršia matka vôbec!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21691 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_f37c949c:
msgid "[_M_] You and your sisters will carry the emotional scars of these years for the rest of your lives."
msgstr "[_M_] Vy a vaše sestry budú niesť citové jazvy týchto rokov pre zvyšok vášho života."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21692 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_643ac9d8:
msgid "[_M_] And now my sister has given me a whole other trash can of shit, and I'm not sure how I'm going to deal with it."
msgstr "[_M_] A teraz mi moja sestra dala celý iný odpad, a nie som si istý, ako sa s tým vysporiadam."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21693 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_4395c0fd:
msgid "[_M_] And I hate myself even more since the only solution I can think of would only expose our family to even more debauchery."
msgstr "[_M_] A ja sa nenávidím ešte viac, pretože jediné riešenie, ktoré môžem myslieť na to, by len vystaviť našu rodinu ešte viac debauchery."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21694 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9040f0a8:
msgid "[_M_] ...."
msgstr "[_M_]...."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21695 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_2f2b8e3d:
msgid "[_R_] You think you stole my innocence!?"
msgstr "Myslíš si, že si mi ukradol moju nevinu?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21696 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_b35cf8cf:
msgid "[_M_] Mmmhmmm..."
msgstr "[_M_] Mmmhmmm ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21697 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_072c8f6c:
msgid "[_R_] That's why you've been avoiding me, acting so awkward around me lately?"
msgstr "[_ R_] To je dôvod, prečo ste sa vyhýli mi, správať sa tak trápne okolo mňa v poslednej dobe?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21698 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e9b20daa:
msgid "[_M_] I mean, what kind of mother would do that to their own son!?"
msgstr "[_M_] Myslím, akú matku by to urobil svojmu vlastnému synu!?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21699 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e270fc30:
msgid "[_R_] Hey, you've got it all wrong!"
msgstr "[_ R_] Hej, všetko je v poriadku!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21700 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_2dcc9a92:
msgid "[_R_] You didn't steal anything from me. You gave me the greatest gift I've ever recieved in my life!"
msgstr "[_ R_] Nekradli ste nič odo mňa. Dal si mi ten najväčší dar, aký som kedy dostal v mojom živote!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21701 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_a47f3fe5:
msgid "[_M_] That's not what your therapist is going to say when your a forty year old man who can't maintain a normal relationship."
msgstr "[_M_] To nie je to, čo váš terapeut povie, keď váš štyridsať rokov starý muž, ktorý nemôže udržať normálny vzťah."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21702 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5e7c4f92:
msgid "[_R_] Fuck my future therapist! When I'm forty years old, I hope I'm still in a relationship with you."
msgstr "[_ R_] Pojeb sa na moju budúcu terapeutku! Keď mám štyridsať rokov, dúfam, že som stále vo vzťahu s vami."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21703 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_073702ba:
msgid "[_M_] Oh, God!... That is just wrong on so many levels."
msgstr "Oh, Bože! To je nesprávne na toľkom úrovniach."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21704 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_df60479b:
msgid "[_R_] Why?"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21705 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e1747726:
msgid "[_M_] In any normal situation..."
msgstr "[_ M_] V každej normálnej situácii ..."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21706 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_18315c88:
msgid "[_R_] I'm going to stop you already."
msgstr "-Už ťa už zastavím."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21709 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5ae26ef2:
msgid "[_R_] We're not in a normal situation."
msgstr "[_ R_] Nie sme v normálnej situácii."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21710 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_48ff853d:
msgid "[_R_] What we're going through is so far away from normal, that we can't be expected to act like we're in a normal situation."
msgstr "[_R_] To, čo prechádzame je tak ďaleko od normálnosti, že nemôžeme očakávať, že sa správame ako v normálnej situácii."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21711 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_2cb484f9:
msgid "[_R_] There's nobody else we can talk to, nobody else we can rely on, nobody else we can expect to understand what it is we're going through."
msgstr "Nie je nikto iný, s kým by sme sa mohli porozprávať, nikto iný sa nespoliehame na to, že nikto iný by sme mohli očakávať, že pochopíme, čím sa prestaneme."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21712 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_440ad8ac:
msgid "[_R_] Right now, the only people we can rely on is each other."
msgstr "[_R_] Práve teraz, jediní ľudia, na ktorých sa môžeme spoľahnúť, je jeden druhého."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21713 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_1d258340:
msgid "[_R_] We need each other!"
msgstr "[_ R_] My sa potrebujeme navzájom!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21714 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_a0bf631e:
msgid "[_R_] If that means we need to work together to pay off debt, then we work together."
msgstr "[_ R_] Ak to znamená, že musíme spolupracovať, aby sme splácali dlh, potom spolupracujeme."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21715 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_68f37c03:
msgid "[_R_] If that means we need to share in the daily chores, then we share them."
msgstr "[_ R_] Ak to znamená, že sa musíme podeliť o denné práce, potom sa o ne podelíme."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21716 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_b75ca185:
msgid "[_R_] If that means if one of us needs to hide a body, we run grab the shovel."
msgstr "[_ R_] Ak to znamená, že ak jeden z nás potrebuje schovať telo, pobežíme chytiť lopatu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21717 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_65997963:
msgid "[_R_] And, if that means we need to help fulfill some unfulfilled needs, we shouldn't have to go searching outside our family to find someone who has no idea what the hell it is we're going through."
msgstr "[_R_] A, ak to znamená, že musíme pomôcť naplniť niektoré nesplnené potreby, nemali by sme ísť hľadať mimo našu rodinu nájsť niekoho, kto nemá tušenie, čo do pekla to je práve prechádzame."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21718 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_1d0c46b0:
msgid "[_R_] How could anyone else possibly know what it is we need to fulfill our needs."
msgstr "[_R_] Ako by mohol niekto iný vedieť, čo potrebujeme, aby sme naplní naše potreby."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21721 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_63de89cb:
msgid "[_M_] You're just talking about me and you, right?"
msgstr "Hovoríš o mne a o tebe, však?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21722 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_5caccafa:
msgid "[_R_] Uh, yeah... Of course."
msgstr "[_R_] Uh, áno ... -Samozrejme."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21725 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_8c9e7d9a:
msgid "[_M_] I mean, yeah... That sounds good in theory, but I'm not sure the application doesn't just burn us all to the ground."
msgstr "[_M_] Myslím, áno ... To znie dobre v teórii, ale nie som si istý, že tá aplikácia nás nespaľuje až na zem."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21726 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_af46234b:
msgid "[_R_] I think it's working out well so far."
msgstr "[_ R_] Myslím, že to funguje dobre tak ďaleko."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21727 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_46dc9055:
msgid "[_M_] You do?!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Vy áno?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21728 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e4484008:
msgid "[_R_] It is for me."
msgstr "[_ R_] To je pre mňa."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21729 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_af31407b:
msgid "[_R_] Sure we're under a shit ton of stress, but I've never felt more fulfilled in my life."
msgstr "[_ R_] Určite sme pod hovno tonu stresu, ale nikdy som sa cítil viac naplní v mojom živote."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21730 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_d7ef9f6d:
msgid "[_R_] I have purpose, I feel ambition, I'm building my self-worth!"
msgstr "[_ R_] Mám svoj účel, mám pocit, ctižiadnosť, stavím si svoju vlastnú hodnotu!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21731 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_c0dfdcff:
msgid "[_R_] I feel like our family is the most valuable thing in the world, and there's nothing I wouldn't do to protect it."
msgstr "[_ R_] Cítim, že naša rodina je najcennou vecou na svete, a nie je nič, čo by som nespravil, aby som ho ochránila."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21732 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_53b0b0a9:
msgid "[_R_] And I'm still not sure exactly what it is that we're building between the two of us, but I can tell you I love it!"
msgstr "[_R_] A stále si nie som istý, čo presne staviame medzi nami dvoma, ale môžem vám povedať, že ho milujem!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21733 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_66643b61:
msgid "[_R_] I want to keep exploring it, and I don't want it to stop."
msgstr "[_ R_] Chcem ju ďalej skúmať, a nechcem, aby to zastavilo."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21734 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_22d389c6:
msgid "[_R_] So don't try to keep me at arms length. I'm here for you."
msgstr "[_ R_] Takže sa nesnažím držať ma na dĺžku zbraní. Som tu pre teba."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21735 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_c9e1c2dd:
msgid "[_R_] That means you can rely on me to carry as much of your load as I possibly can handle. You shouldn't have to carry this burden alone."
msgstr "[_ R_] To znamená, že sa môžete spoľahnúť na mňa niesť toľko svojho nákladu, ako som možno mohol zvládnuť. Nemali by ste niesť túto záťaž sama."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21736 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_aafde1f9:
msgid "[_R_] Hell, I'm not going to let you."
msgstr "Peklo, nedovolím ti."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21737 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9de09c6e:
msgid "[_R_] I've got some great ideas to get us out of this mess, and I'm going to make you listen to them!"
msgstr "[_ R_] Mám nejaké skvelé nápady, aby nás z tohto neporiadku, a chystám sa, aby ste si ich vypočuť!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21740 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_41418020:
msgid "[_M_] Oh, [ryan]!"
msgstr "Oh, [ryan]!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21741 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_e1ad8589:
msgid "[_M_] You have no idea how much this helps me!"
msgstr "[_ M_] Nemáte tušenie, ako veľmi to pomáha mne!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21742 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_aaecf4de:
msgid "[_M_] I need your strength right now."
