# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21799 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_9de175e2:
msgid "[_M_] I just don't know if I can do that kind of thing with my own sister, who I hate right now, by the way."
