# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21804 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_3268e4fe:
msgid "[_R_] And, if we don't pay Joey back soon, he'll have the two of you up on stage doing the very same thing anyways. Only, you'll both be doing it every night together until you're both too old to shake your asses."
