# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21805 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_ac22c150:
msgid "[_R_] At least this way, we're in control, it's a one time thing. Well, it might take multiple shoots to get all the type of content we need, but better than every single night for years."
