# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:21809 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_aunt_06_eb119609:
msgid "[_R_] You're not old, but you are both sexy. The fact that you're sisters will have the internet going crazy."
