# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37012 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_04aea389:
msgid "[_S_] More like you don't want Mom to shut you down when she realizes you're posting sexy pictures of her daughter online."
