# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37155 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_b0c367f5:
msgid "[_L_] Oh my gosh! You've upgraded the place! New professional looking lights, and a background that's green for some reason."
msgstr "[_L_] Panebože! Vylepšil si to tu! Nové profesionálne vyzerajúce svetlá a pozadie, ktoré je z nejakého dôvodu zelené."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37156 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_f490f007:
msgid "[_R_] The green screen will make it so we can add any background we want to the pictures later."
msgstr "[_R_] Vďaka tomu budeme môcť neskôr do obrázkov pridať ľubovoľné pozadie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37157 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_5b03caaa_2:
msgid "[_R_] I've been playing with the ZAD 3D computer program, and I should be able to do a lot of fun effects with the pictures we take."
msgstr "[_R_] Hral som sa s počítačovým programom ZAD 3D a mal by som byť schopný urobiť veľa zábavných efektov s fotografiami, ktoré sme urobili."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37158 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_29f698dc:
msgid "[_R_] The lights will just make the quality of the pictures so much better. They will definitely be worth every penny we paid for them."
msgstr "[_R_] Vďaka svetlám bude kvalita fotografií oveľa lepšia. Určite budú stáť za každý cent, ktorý sme za ne zaplatili."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37159 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_a95fb8ea:
msgid "[_L_] Awesome! I can't wait the see how the pictures turn out."
msgstr "[_L_] Úžasné! Už sa neviem dočkať, ako dopadnú fotky."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37168 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_9da9f321:
msgid "[_R_] So, are you ready to get going?"
msgstr "[_R_] Takže si pripravená pokračovať?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37169 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_ced5b1ed:
msgid "[_L_] So ready!"
msgstr "[_L_] Tak pripravený!"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37170 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_ecbdb247:
msgid "[_R_] Ok, just run to the supply closet and get changed into your costume while I get a few more small details ready for the shoot."
msgstr "[_R_] Dobre, len bež do šatníka a prezleč sa do kostýmu, zatiaľ čo ja pripravím ešte pár drobností na fotenie."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37180 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_1289404c:
msgid "[_L_] Ok, I'm dressed, but I'm a little nervous about the shoot."
msgstr "[_L_] Dobre, som oblečená, ale z fotenia som trochu nervózna."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37182 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_a636a010:
msgid "[_R_] Ok Lauren, I know this is only the second photoshoot you've ever done."
msgstr "[_R_] Ok Lauren, viem, že toto je len druhé fotenie, ktoré si kedy robila."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37183 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_dbf8554f:
msgid "[_R_] But I'm going to try to be as professional as possible."
msgstr "[_R_] Ale budem sa snažiť byť čo najprofesionálnejší."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37184 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_27635596:
msgid "[_R_] I might push you a little bit out of your comfort zone, but remember, it's just because I know what people want to see on the internet,"
msgstr "[_R_] Možno ťa trochu vytlačím z tvojej komfortnej zóny, ale pamätaj si, že je to len preto, že viem, čo chcú ľudia vidieť na internete,"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37185 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_cce27e3c:
msgid "[_R_] And I'll only be suggesting things that will get you more likes and more money to help pay Mom's Mafia debt."
msgstr "[_R_] A budem navrhovať len veci, ktoré prinesú viac lajkov a viac peňazí, aby som mohla zaplatiť mamin mafiánsky dlh."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37186 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_c6d6b4fb:
msgid "[_R_] If you're too uncomfortable to go any further with the shoot, we'll just call it a day, and see how we feel on the next one."
msgstr "[_R_] Ak ti je príliš nepríjemné pokračovať vo fotografovaní, jednoducho to ukončíme a uvidíme, ako sa budeš cítiť pri ďalšom fotografovaní."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37187 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_8a4f6d1d:
msgid "[_R_] So are you ready?"
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37188 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_9676be82:
msgid "[_L_] I think so. Thanks for being so professional, I almost forgot you were my brother for a second."
msgstr "[_L_] Myslím, že áno. Vďaka za profesionalitu, na chvíľu som takmer zabudla, že si môj brat."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37189 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_8ce0192a:
msgid "[_R_] Good! Go with that. Try to think of me as a professional photographer who's going to make you an internet sensation."
msgstr "[_R_] Dobre! Choď s tým. Skús si ma predstaviť ako profesionálneho fotografa, ktorý z teba urobí internetovú senzáciu."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37190 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_113b5ada:
msgid "[_L_] And you ruined it, now you're just my brother again."
msgstr "[_L_] A ty si to zničil, teraz si opäť len môj brat."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37191 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_bcf5ed5a:
msgid "[_R_] Ok, smartass, let's just get started."
msgstr "[_R_] Dobre, chytráčka, začnime."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37193 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_20becdeb:
msgid "[_R_] Ok Lauren, try not to be nervous, I'll try to be even more professional than last time."
msgstr "[_R_] Ok Lauren, snaž sa nebyť nervózna, pokúsim sa byť ešte profesionálnejšia ako minule."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37194 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_4d6b1398:
msgid "[_R_] Just try to be open to more of my suggestions. Like I said before, I'm just trying to make your pictures get as many likes as possible."
msgstr "[_R_] Len sa pokús byť otvorená ďalším mojim návrhom. Ako som už povedal, snažím sa len o to, aby tvoje obrázky získali čo najviac lajkov."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37195 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_f6085fd5:
msgid "[_L_] It's just seems like you're being really pervy sometimes."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37196 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_10d0a1f3:
msgid "[_R_] Don't forget I'm your brother. I love you, and I've got your best interest at heart. You're safer with me, than anybody else."
msgstr ""

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37197 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_9b1e72e2:
msgid "[_L_] Yeah, yeah, let's just get this photoshoot started."
msgstr "[_L_] Áno, áno, poďme začať s fotením."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37198 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_0a2f67db:
msgid "[_R_] Ok, let's start out with a pose like a warrior hunting in the forest."
msgstr "[_R_] Dobre, začneme pózou ako bojovník na love v lese."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37205 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_3b8def9e:
msgid "[_L_] How's this?"
msgstr "[_L_] Aké je to?"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:37206 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_cosplay_02_b0531b6c:
msgid "[_R_] It's great!"
